(2576418, 355471, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very well executed photo as far as lighting and exposure go, but the composition is a problem.  When you have objects close to the edge of the frame, you either need to cut them off where it looks intentional or include them completely within the frame.  When your subjects just barely touch the edge, it creates an uncomfortable view...</td>', 'This is a very well executed photo as far as lighting and exposure go, but the composition is a problem.  When you have objects close to the edge of the frame, you either need to cut them off where it looks intentional or include them completely within the frame.  When your subjects just barely touch the edge, it creates an uncomfortable view...', '2006-07-03 01:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
