(2577855, 356260, 55956, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a good shot and the idea is good. I prefer that the separation between the green and white background was on the line of the waterfall with the upper flower a bit on the left.<br/>best regards</td>', 'I think that this is a good shot and the idea is good. I prefer that the separation between the green and white background was on the line of the waterfall with the upper flower a bit on the left.best regards', '2006-07-03 05:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
