(2581090, 357075, 19944, '<td valign="top">Oh my, those flowers on the top are really blown-out.  They actually hurt my eyes.  Perhaps tone down the lighting, or burn them slightly in post processing?</td>', 'Oh my, those flowers on the top are really blown-out.  They actually hurt my eyes.  Perhaps tone down the lighting, or burn them slightly in post processing?', '2006-07-03 22:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581092, 355722, 45596, '<td valign="top">Way cool!</td>', 'Way cool!', '2006-07-03 22:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581093, 357237, 19944, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, and great color.  Just slightly distracted by the blue in the bottom right corner.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, and great color.  Just slightly distracted by the blue in the bottom right corner.', '2006-07-03 22:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581097, 355817, 45596, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but I would have made the photo larger by using the full 640 pixels.</td>', 'Good photo, but I would have made the photo larger by using the full 640 pixels.', '2006-07-03 22:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581099, 356069, 19944, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, but I think a tighter crop would look better.  But that''s just me.</td>', 'I like this idea, but I think a tighter crop would look better.  But that''s just me.', '2006-07-03 22:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581105, 355504, 19944, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I love the black &amp; white, I love the dead flowers, and I actually like that it doesn''t seem super sharp.  That being said, I have a bad feeling it won''t do well.  Around these parts, people like sharp, colorful, living flowers.</td>', 'I really like this.  I love the black & white, I love the dead flowers, and I actually like that it doesn''t seem super sharp.  That being said, I have a bad feeling it won''t do well.  Around these parts, people like sharp, colorful, living flowers.', '2006-07-03 22:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581109, 355854, 19944, '<td valign="top">Ladybug slumming it on vacation this year?  <br/> <br/>Yes, I like the ratty looking flower.  Flowers get like that.  It''s part of nature.  I think it could have been a little sharper, but well done none-the-less.</td>', 'Ladybug slumming it on vacation this year?   Yes, I like the ratty looking flower.  Flowers get like that.  It''s part of nature.  I think it could have been a little sharper, but well done none-the-less.', '2006-07-03 22:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581113, 357366, 19944, '<td valign="top">I dig black and white flower shots, and I think I would really like this one, if it weren''t so dark.  But some people like that.</td>', 'I dig black and white flower shots, and I think I would really like this one, if it weren''t so dark.  But some people like that.', '2006-07-03 22:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581116, 356262, 19944, '<td valign="top">If you stare at this long enough, it''s almost like it''s pulsating.  Really.  try it.  Scary.<br/> <br/>Nice and sharp against a nice bokeh background.  Well done.</td>', 'If you stare at this long enough, it''s almost like it''s pulsating.  Really.  try it.  Scary. Nice and sharp against a nice bokeh background.  Well done.', '2006-07-03 22:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581120, 357347, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro, love the way the flower glows, colours are wonderful.</td>', 'Beautiful macro, love the way the flower glows, colours are wonderful.', '2006-07-03 22:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581121, 357238, 43774, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity. Really a beautiful photo but some may think it is too busy (I don''t).</td>', 'Excellent clarity. Really a beautiful photo but some may think it is too busy (I don''t).', '2006-07-03 22:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581122, 355534, 43774, '<td valign="top">Excellent comp, the water drops are a great addition.</td>', 'Excellent comp, the water drops are a great addition.', '2006-07-03 22:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581126, 355893, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a unique flower. Good photo of it, good composition.</td>', 'What a unique flower. Good photo of it, good composition.', '2006-07-03 22:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2581127, 357123, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colour and comp</td>', 'Wonderful colour and comp', '2006-07-03 22:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
