(2581129, 356345, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very well done, love the contrast of the colourful flower and colourless background, as well as the contrast of nature vs. man.</td>', 'Very well done, love the contrast of the colourful flower and colourless background, as well as the contrast of nature vs. man.', '2006-07-03 22:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
