(2581135, 355488, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely tulips, excellent composition. My only nit-pick is that they seem to fade into the background slightly at the top, or they are a bit washed out there.</td>', 'Lovely tulips, excellent composition. My only nit-pick is that they seem to fade into the background slightly at the top, or they are a bit washed out there.', '2006-07-03 22:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
