(2583000, 357346, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The figure just needs a little more form, IMO.  The stereotypical elements (bottom or rounding of breast) which tell the viewer instantly that this is a human body are missing.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The figure just needs a little more form, IMO.  The stereotypical elements (bottom or rounding of breast) which tell the viewer instantly that this is a human body are missing.', '2006-07-04 08:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583006, 355110, 51538, '<td valign="top">Fuchsia - a wonderful, classic subject.  One of the nicest of flower shrumbs in any garden.  To focus on these wonderful examples, I would have completely cropped out the right hand side wrought iron work.</td>', 'Fuchsia - a wonderful, classic subject.  One of the nicest of flower shrumbs in any garden.  To focus on these wonderful examples, I would have completely cropped out the right hand side wrought iron work.', '2006-07-04 08:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583008, 356153, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice clean flower specimens.  Good detail.</td>', 'Nice clean flower specimens.  Good detail.', '2006-07-04 08:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583012, 355822, 51538, '<td valign="top">Woodland indeed and beautiful too.  Bracken heath and digitalis are a perfect duo.  I really like this a lot - partly because it reminds me of a place I played in during my youth in Sussex, England. 8.</td>', 'Woodland indeed and beautiful too.  Bracken heath and digitalis are a perfect duo.  I really like this a lot - partly because it reminds me of a place I played in during my youth in Sussex, England. 8.', '2006-07-04 08:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583014, 357268, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely focus and DOF.  Very clean whites and lovely detail.  You captured the daisy-ness of daisies. 8.</td>', 'Lovely focus and DOF.  Very clean whites and lovely detail.  You captured the daisy-ness of daisies. 8.', '2006-07-04 08:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583015, 357339, 51538, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Nice to see the fun side of this challenge on display.</td>', 'Good idea.  Nice to see the fun side of this challenge on display.', '2006-07-04 08:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
