(2583025, 355923, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice to have the in situ view.  I think you did well with this.  The flower is nice and sharp. 7.</td>', 'Nice to have the in situ view.  I think you did well with this.  The flower is nice and sharp. 7.', '2006-07-04 08:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
