(2583028, 355702, 51538, '<td valign="top">Patience is a virtue - you must be a very virtuous person to have carefully desaturated all around the flowers.  But somehow, I think I might prefer the rustic nature of walls and dirt to be added to this English Country Garden.</td>', 'Patience is a virtue - you must be a very virtuous person to have carefully desaturated all around the flowers.  But somehow, I think I might prefer the rustic nature of walls and dirt to be added to this English Country Garden.', '2006-07-04 08:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583029, 357141, 51538, '<td valign="top">I hear that this year they are even better than usual.  Elderberry wine, champagn, and syrup are some of my favourites.  It is a wonderful plant.  Reminds me of my England home. 8.</td>', 'I hear that this year they are even better than usual.  Elderberry wine, champagn, and syrup are some of my favourites.  It is a wonderful plant.  Reminds me of my England home. 8.', '2006-07-04 08:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583034, 357159, 51538, '<td valign="top">A trio works to give unbalanced energy to the picture and your selection is wonderful.  I wonder whether the rushes at the top should be cropped out?</td>', 'A trio works to give unbalanced energy to the picture and your selection is wonderful.  I wonder whether the rushes at the top should be cropped out?', '2006-07-04 08:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583036, 355861, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very nice rendition. 8.</td>', 'Very nice rendition. 8.', '2006-07-04 08:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
