(2583082, 357327, 51538, '<td valign="top">An American euphanism.  Brassica napus has a common name of Rape in England and Europe.  It is a member of the mustard family.  Nice photo.  I would have processed the sky to a much more lively hue of blue.  Or got up early in the morning and re-shot the location. 7.</td>', 'An American euphanism.  Brassica napus has a common name of Rape in England and Europe.  It is a member of the mustard family.  Nice photo.  I would have processed the sky to a much more lively hue of blue.  Or got up early in the morning and re-shot the location. 7.', '2006-07-04 09:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583089, 355290, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty rendition and well composed.  Nice specimen flower. 8.</td>', 'Pretty rendition and well composed.  Nice specimen flower. 8.', '2006-07-04 09:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583113, 356393, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful DOF and colours, this is lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful DOF and colours, this is lovely.', '2006-07-04 09:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583117, 356260, 43774, '<td valign="top">I love the set up with the flowers and the water. I also like the 2 colours you chose for the background but I am not fond of the straight division right down the middle. I''d like to see it on an angle. Still deserving of an 8 from me.</td>', 'I love the set up with the flowers and the water. I also like the 2 colours you chose for the background but I am not fond of the straight division right down the middle. I''d like to see it on an angle. Still deserving of an 8 from me.', '2006-07-04 09:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583119, 356193, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cute! Great lighting and colours.</td>', 'Very cute! Great lighting and colours.', '2006-07-04 09:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583123, 355861, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work on this, the colours and tones are lovely. I like your frame too, it looks like a fine art poster.</td>', 'Beautiful work on this, the colours and tones are lovely. I like your frame too, it looks like a fine art poster.', '2006-07-04 09:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583125, 357284, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a stunning flower! Beautiful detail in your photo, excellent clarity and colours.</td>', 'What a stunning flower! Beautiful detail in your photo, excellent clarity and colours.', '2006-07-04 09:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
