(2583132, 356715, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow! This macro is amazing. From the thumbnail it looks like the entrance to a clearing in the forest with the sun shining down. I really like this, it certainly shows your creativity.</td>', 'Wow! This macro is amazing. From the thumbnail it looks like the entrance to a clearing in the forest with the sun shining down. I really like this, it certainly shows your creativity.', '2006-07-04 09:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
