(2583137, 356903, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective. That must be a huge flower, the butterfly gives it scale. I really like the colours and comp.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective. That must be a huge flower, the butterfly gives it scale. I really like the colours and comp.', '2006-07-04 09:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
