(2583153, 356340, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity and colours. Not sure I like the bottom one chopped off, but other than that it''s great.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity and colours. Not sure I like the bottom one chopped off, but other than that it''s great.', '2006-07-04 09:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583156, 355723, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower and photo. Not as tack sharp as some others in the challenge, but still well done.</td>', 'Lovely flower and photo. Not as tack sharp as some others in the challenge, but still well done.', '2006-07-04 09:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583160, 357049, 43774, '<td valign="top">I love this wildflower, they are growing all over the place here (nickname is Devil''s Paintbrush). I like your photo but I think it could use a little contrast or saturation just to make it pop a bit more.</td>', 'I love this wildflower, they are growing all over the place here (nickname is Devil''s Paintbrush). I like your photo but I think it could use a little contrast or saturation just to make it pop a bit more.', '2006-07-04 09:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583162, 355296, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, good detail on the center, the front out of focus area is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice macro, good detail on the center, the front out of focus area is a bit distracting.', '2006-07-04 09:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583167, 355772, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice flower and good central placement of it. Could probably use a bit of contrast or brightening up, seems a bit dull. You could reshoot this and enter it in the fireworks challenge and call it nature''s fireworks because that''s what it looks like....neat.</td>', 'Nice flower and good central placement of it. Could probably use a bit of contrast or brightening up, seems a bit dull. You could reshoot this and enter it in the fireworks challenge and call it nature''s fireworks because that''s what it looks like....neat.', '2006-07-04 09:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583169, 355642, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Would like to see more DOF so that the stamens were also in focus.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Would like to see more DOF so that the stamens were also in focus.', '2006-07-04 09:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583172, 357355, 43774, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous field of flowers. Lower left corner is out of focus and I think it would be better if the entire photo were in focus.</td>', 'Gorgeous field of flowers. Lower left corner is out of focus and I think it would be better if the entire photo were in focus.', '2006-07-04 09:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583177, 356358, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good placement in the frame. Glare on flower is a bit distracting. Would like to see more DOF too. The centre part is tack sharp and has great detail.</td>', 'Good placement in the frame. Glare on flower is a bit distracting. Would like to see more DOF too. The centre part is tack sharp and has great detail.', '2006-07-04 09:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583182, 357186, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture! I''ve never seen a bluebird before, let alone one on a flower. Excellent composition although there seems to be some noise in the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful capture! I''ve never seen a bluebird before, let alone one on a flower. Excellent composition although there seems to be some noise in the photo.', '2006-07-04 09:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583184, 355449, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and background</td>', 'Nice DOF and background', '2006-07-04 09:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583189, 356175, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love this field and the girl....wish she weren''t looking at the camera, though. Might be nice if she were picking a flower or smelling one. I also don''t like your title, for such a pretty photo it''s a crude title.</td>', 'Love this field and the girl....wish she weren''t looking at the camera, though. Might be nice if she were picking a flower or smelling one. I also don''t like your title, for such a pretty photo it''s a crude title.', '2006-07-04 09:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583198, 356455, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute set up, sort of like Wonderbread''s photo with flowers in her hair. I like the all white background. The angle of the girl''s head seems a bit funny, like she has her chin down. I wonder what it would look like if she had her entire face looking up, not just her eyes?</td>', 'Cute set up, sort of like Wonderbread''s photo with flowers in her hair. I like the all white background. The angle of the girl''s head seems a bit funny, like she has her chin down. I wonder what it would look like if she had her entire face looking up, not just her eyes?', '2006-07-04 09:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583202, 356822, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflection, good colours. I''d like to see a bit more DOF. Good frame too.</td>', 'Nice use of reflection, good colours. I''d like to see a bit more DOF. Good frame too.', '2006-07-04 09:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583227, 356796, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is cute, it looks like a combination of Wonderbread''s photo where she has flowers in here hair and karmabreeze''s &amp; Biteme''s photos where they have a flower in their mouths. I like the lighting, I think the flower in her mouth might be a bit too big. I immediately focus on the models'' eyes and to me they look tired, and that doesn''t fit the rest of the photo.</td>', 'This is cute, it looks like a combination of Wonderbread''s photo where she has flowers in here hair and karmabreeze''s & Biteme''s photos where they have a flower in their mouths. I like the lighting, I think the flower in her mouth might be a bit too big. I immediately focus on the models'' eyes and to me they look tired, and that doesn''t fit the rest of the photo.', '2006-07-04 09:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583245, 355958, 51538, '<td valign="top">Considering the number of bulbs used by photographers, I would not be surprised to see an entrepreneur start selling ones in which the glass had been cut away ready for insertion of....  Cliched but clever. 7.</td>', 'Considering the number of bulbs used by photographers, I would not be surprised to see an entrepreneur start selling ones in which the glass had been cut away ready for insertion of....  Cliched but clever. 7.', '2006-07-04 09:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583261, 356982, 51538, '<td valign="top">Has a lot of potential.  But the flower is a bit on the bright side for my taste.</td>', 'Has a lot of potential.  But the flower is a bit on the bright side for my taste.', '2006-07-04 09:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
