(2583319, 355081, 51538, '<td valign="top">Hybiscus - not an easy flower to photograph closely.  You did a wonderful job and the colours of both flower and sky are excellent. 9.</td>', 'Hybiscus - not an easy flower to photograph closely.  You did a wonderful job and the colours of both flower and sky are excellent. 9.', '2006-07-04 10:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
