(2583324, 355250, 51538, '<td valign="top">Indeed, as the title says.  A delicate portrayal of a lovely garden.  Lovely work from someone who obviously has a high appreciation of art. 9.</td>', 'Indeed, as the title says.  A delicate portrayal of a lovely garden.  Lovely work from someone who obviously has a high appreciation of art. 9.', '2006-07-04 10:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
