(2583560, 355816, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love the idea...  I think it would have been a little more effective if the top petals were standing up and visible rather than edge-on.  I''m undecided if the eyebrows should be visible or not ... you''d have to play with just how high up the top petals should go.<br/> <br/>In any case, I love the color scheme (red/green) and the model is just gorgeous with those pretty blue eyes and soft skin.  Lighting is excellent giving highlights in the eyes and on the lips with a nice soft lighting on the cheeks.  Well done.</td>', 'Love the idea...  I think it would have been a little more effective if the top petals were standing up and visible rather than edge-on.  I''m undecided if the eyebrows should be visible or not ... you''d have to play with just how high up the top petals should go. In any case, I love the color scheme (red/green) and the model is just gorgeous with those pretty blue eyes and soft skin.  Lighting is excellent giving highlights in the eyes and on the lips with a nice soft lighting on the cheeks.  Well done.', '2006-07-04 11:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583567, 355538, 34915, '<td valign="top">Boston ? Coply Square?</td>', 'Boston ? Coply Square?', '2006-07-04 11:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583568, 355368, 19982, '<td valign="top">For me, the colors just aren''t right "together".  I think a little playing around with the "hue" part of the hue/sat adjustment might result in a little more pleasing color scheme.  Also, I recommend using the History Brush after applying USM so that you can undo the parts that become too sharpened - like the antenae and the edge of the butterfly wing.<br/> <br/>Other than that ... love the idea.  I swear I hardly ever see butterflies any more (I remember seeing so many in my childhood, I wonder where they''ve gone?).   Also, the shallow DOF works well here.</td>', 'For me, the colors just aren''t right "together".  I think a little playing around with the "hue" part of the hue/sat adjustment might result in a little more pleasing color scheme.  Also, I recommend using the History Brush after applying USM so that you can undo the parts that become too sharpened - like the antenae and the edge of the butterfly wing. Other than that ... love the idea.  I swear I hardly ever see butterflies any more (I remember seeing so many in my childhood, I wonder where they''ve gone?).   Also, the shallow DOF works well here.', '2006-07-04 11:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583579, 357339, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very cute and creative.  Extra point for the knome!  Hee Hee.</td>', 'Very cute and creative.  Extra point for the knome!  Hee Hee.', '2006-07-04 12:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583582, 356306, 19982, '<td valign="top">The image is just too busy ... too much to look at with nothing for your eyes to really land on.  Zoom in / simplify / look either for a strong subject or a strong pattern without a subject.<br/> <br/>The selective desat is interesting ... but not too useful in that it''s so small it''s almost unnoticeable at a quick glance.  But at least it does force the gaze upon the flowers rather than the grass.</td>', 'The image is just too busy ... too much to look at with nothing for your eyes to really land on.  Zoom in / simplify / look either for a strong subject or a strong pattern without a subject. The selective desat is interesting ... but not too useful in that it''s so small it''s almost unnoticeable at a quick glance.  But at least it does force the gaze upon the flowers rather than the grass.', '2006-07-04 12:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583647, 355250, 52549, '<td valign="top">Background''s a bit distracting for my taste but the overall look is very nice.</td>', 'Background''s a bit distracting for my taste but the overall look is very nice.', '2006-07-04 12:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583661, 356948, 52549, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but the focus point is too far into the background and leaves the main subject looking blurred.</td>', 'Nice colours but the focus point is too far into the background and leaves the main subject looking blurred.', '2006-07-04 12:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583664, 355523, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very fragile looking. Nice.</td>', 'Very fragile looking. Nice.', '2006-07-04 12:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583670, 355722, 52549, '<td valign="top">Focus point seems to be more on the hands than on the flower.</td>', 'Focus point seems to be more on the hands than on the flower.', '2006-07-04 12:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2583680, 355772, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2006-07-04 12:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
