(2584987, 356765, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I LOVE the unusual viewpoint and composition of this. Wonderful choice of angle for this shot. I also like that I can still see the texture on the larger petals, even though they are not the main ''focus'' of the shot.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I LOVE the unusual viewpoint and composition of this. Wonderful choice of angle for this shot. I also like that I can still see the texture on the larger petals, even though they are not the main ''focus'' of the shot.', '2006-07-04 19:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584988, 356822, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. A real gem. Even though the colors are a bit muted, this has a very ''fresh'' feel to it. The border works really well with it; the color matches the flower perfectly. 10</td>', 'Beautiful. A real gem. Even though the colors are a bit muted, this has a very ''fresh'' feel to it. The border works really well with it; the color matches the flower perfectly. 10', '2006-07-04 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584989, 355215, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully done. The angle is perfect, and the colors just pop right out of the background. This is very visually interesting to me - I keep looking  and looking and still seem to find new ''bits'' to see. 10.</td>', 'This is beautifully done. The angle is perfect, and the colors just pop right out of the background. This is very visually interesting to me - I keep looking  and looking and still seem to find new ''bits'' to see. 10.', '2006-07-04 19:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584990, 357144, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is really neat. Very original. The lighting is just perfect for it. 10.</td>', 'This is really neat. Very original. The lighting is just perfect for it. 10.', '2006-07-04 19:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584992, 355124, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is great! I love the point-of-view! All of the lines and curves and colors work really great together. The clarity in the detail is superb. 10.</td>', 'This is great! I love the point-of-view! All of the lines and curves and colors work really great together. The clarity in the detail is superb. 10.', '2006-07-04 19:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584993, 357123, 35645, '<td valign="top">Wow. The colors and lines of this are just beautiful. I could go either way about the border - it''s not annoying, but it doesn''t seem to add anything either. But the flower itself is just Wow.</td>', 'Wow. The colors and lines of this are just beautiful. I could go either way about the border - it''s not annoying, but it doesn''t seem to add anything either. But the flower itself is just Wow.', '2006-07-04 19:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584995, 357186, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice. The contrast of colors between the bluebird, the flower, and the background works really well.</td>', 'This is quite nice. The contrast of colors between the bluebird, the flower, and the background works really well.', '2006-07-04 19:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584996, 356903, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like how this shows that beauty isn''t always where we expect it.</td>', 'I like how this shows that beauty isn''t always where we expect it.', '2006-07-04 19:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584997, 355252, 35645, '<td valign="top">Refreshing to see that a flower can be just as beautiful in B&amp;W as it is in color. Beautiful textures and detail here. Lovely composition.</td>', 'Refreshing to see that a flower can be just as beautiful in B&W as it is in color. Beautiful textures and detail here. Lovely composition.', '2006-07-04 19:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584998, 355484, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very neat flower! I love the diagonal lines in the pic, and the water on the petals is just spectacular!</td>', 'Very neat flower! I love the diagonal lines in the pic, and the water on the petals is just spectacular!', '2006-07-04 19:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585000, 355534, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful in its simplicity. Great lighting, wonderful lines - altogether a beauty of a shot.</td>', 'Beautiful in its simplicity. Great lighting, wonderful lines - altogether a beauty of a shot.', '2006-07-04 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585001, 353994, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful. Evokes the feeling of being in a dream...</td>', 'This is really beautiful. Evokes the feeling of being in a dream...', '2006-07-04 19:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585003, 357166, 35645, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy! Beautiful lighting. I love that you can see all of the textures very clearly.</td>', 'Looks yummy! Beautiful lighting. I love that you can see all of the textures very clearly.', '2006-07-04 19:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585004, 356855, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is quite pretty. I love the line of the arc that the stem makes. The colors are very nice, and the fact that the background isn''t *quite* black really works well for me.</td>', 'This is quite pretty. I love the line of the arc that the stem makes. The colors are very nice, and the fact that the background isn''t *quite* black really works well for me.', '2006-07-04 19:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585005, 357331, 35645, '<td valign="top">This gave me a smile. Very well-done allusion to ''Alice in Wonderland''. The skirt should perhaps have been ironed, but that''s a minor thing.</td>', 'This gave me a smile. Very well-done allusion to ''Alice in Wonderland''. The skirt should perhaps have been ironed, but that''s a minor thing.', '2006-07-04 19:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585006, 356843, 35645, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of an M. C. Escher print. Nicely done.</td>', 'Reminds me of an M. C. Escher print. Nicely done.', '2006-07-04 19:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585007, 356989, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like it. It''s very bold, very striking, and very colorful.</td>', 'I like it. It''s very bold, very striking, and very colorful.', '2006-07-04 19:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585008, 353905, 35645, '<td valign="top">Wow. Now that is a menacing flower. I like that you''ve captured that ''essence'' of danger with this shot.</td>', 'Wow. Now that is a menacing flower. I like that you''ve captured that ''essence'' of danger with this shot.', '2006-07-04 19:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585093, 356985, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very unique idea. 8</td>', 'Very unique idea. 8', '2006-07-04 20:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585111, 357141, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Toning works well.  Like the composition and crop/framing.  Difficult, but perhaps the slightest nudge rotate up on the left, although not sure on that.  The detail is likely there ''bigger'', however just to discern a bit more in this, but could be the coloring/toning effect, diminishing the detail and causing areas to seem slightly ''blown''.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Toning works well.  Like the composition and crop/framing.  Difficult, but perhaps the slightest nudge rotate up on the left, although not sure on that.  The detail is likely there ''bigger'', however just to discern a bit more in this, but could be the coloring/toning effect, diminishing the detail and causing areas to seem slightly ''blown''.', '2006-07-04 20:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585120, 357049, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice sharp detail on the flower and just the right amount of DOF.  Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice sharp detail on the flower and just the right amount of DOF.  Very nice!', '2006-07-04 20:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585123, 356887, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice color palatte and a clever idea.  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice color palatte and a clever idea.  Great job!', '2006-07-04 20:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585128, 355124, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the concept.  Difficult, but sharper for what seems to be a macro, more definition in the textures and overall more balance compositionally - possibly more height, more off-center as well, not sure - make this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.  Like the title.</td>', '6 - Like the concept.  Difficult, but sharper for what seems to be a macro, more definition in the textures and overall more balance compositionally - possibly more height, more off-center as well, not sure - make this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.  Like the title.', '2006-07-04 20:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585131, 355122, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very beautifully colored flowers.  Great exposure on them but the composition seems a tad busy.</td>', 'Very beautifully colored flowers.  Great exposure on them but the composition seems a tad busy.', '2006-07-04 20:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585133, 354296, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice study.  Difficult with the pp / effects, however more texture/detail make this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice study.  Difficult with the pp / effects, however more texture/detail make this better in my opinion.', '2006-07-04 20:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585139, 356150, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great macro with the little water droplets, they add a bit of mystery and enchantment.  Very nice!</td>', 'Great macro with the little water droplets, they add a bit of mystery and enchantment.  Very nice!', '2006-07-04 20:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585143, 355394, 42100, '<td valign="top">A very theatric photograph, very clever idea and well executed.  Well done!</td>', 'A very theatric photograph, very clever idea and well executed.  Well done!', '2006-07-04 20:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585146, 357166, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice flower, and food shot - just looks like it is ''cut off'' at the base/bottom, which the frame emphasizes.  Perhaps a variation in the composition, with the flower more centered, or different angle, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice flower, and food shot - just looks like it is ''cut off'' at the base/bottom, which the frame emphasizes.  Perhaps a variation in the composition, with the flower more centered, or different angle, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-07-04 20:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585150, 356642, 42100, '<td valign="top">Lots of great texture and detail throughout.  Very nice!</td>', 'Lots of great texture and detail throughout.  Very nice!', '2006-07-04 20:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585152, 355930, 42100, '<td valign="top">Somebody went to Roxborough, now to figure out who!?!  Very nice, great saturation in the sky.</td>', 'Somebody went to Roxborough, now to figure out who!?!  Very nice, great saturation in the sky.', '2006-07-04 20:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585158, 355840, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the concept, fairly good macro, good and unusual shallow dof in the center.  Variation in composition, bringing in more space and ''balance'',  as well as a more refined crop, especially top left, make this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '6 - Like the concept, fairly good macro, good and unusual shallow dof in the center.  Variation in composition, bringing in more space and ''balance'',  as well as a more refined crop, especially top left, make this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.', '2006-07-04 20:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585162, 355471, 42100, '<td valign="top">The red tulips look very good against the deep blue sky.  Very beautiful photo!</td>', 'The red tulips look very good against the deep blue sky.  Very beautiful photo!', '2006-07-04 20:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585163, 356887, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Certainly different.  Like the concept.  Good color combinations.  Perhaps a variation in angle/perspective may have given this a little extra.  Fairly minor, but the lighting &amp; background/base gives this a bit of a slightly ''sterile'' type feel overall in my opinion.  Difficult, but if the flowers on the spoon were as well focussed, etc as the ones in the bowl, also make this better.  Like your title.</td>', '7 - Certainly different.  Like the concept.  Good color combinations.  Perhaps a variation in angle/perspective may have given this a little extra.  Fairly minor, but the lighting & background/base gives this a bit of a slightly ''sterile'' type feel overall in my opinion.  Difficult, but if the flowers on the spoon were as well focussed, etc as the ones in the bowl, also make this better.  Like your title.', '2006-07-04 20:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585181, 355992, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Really like this concept, make a good study of a hibiscus.  For a (seemingly) macro such as this, I''d like to see a lot more detail, overall looks too soft.  Sharpest focus seems to be on the stem behind the stigma/stigmata... just wish the dof was a little deeper to include the tips of the ''balls''.  Colors are nice.  Perhaps also a little more top and bottom, to make it ''bigger'', but difficult with the size restrictions.  Nice title.</td>', '5 - Really like this concept, make a good study of a hibiscus.  For a (seemingly) macro such as this, I''d like to see a lot more detail, overall looks too soft.  Sharpest focus seems to be on the stem behind the stigma/stigmata... just wish the dof was a little deeper to include the tips of the ''balls''.  Colors are nice.  Perhaps also a little more top and bottom, to make it ''bigger'', but difficult with the size restrictions.  Nice title.', '2006-07-04 21:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585182, 355893, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Oh, nice.  Mainly the background detracts in my opinion.  A variation in composition may also have given this a little extra.</td>', '6 - Oh, nice.  Mainly the background detracts in my opinion.  A variation in composition may also have given this a little extra.', '2006-07-04 21:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585187, 355507, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful, I like the colours in your image.</td>', 'Very peaceful, I like the colours in your image.', '2006-07-04 21:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585188, 357209, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice concept and set up.  A more ''particular'' focal point(s) and a variation in composition for more balance, make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice concept and set up.  A more ''particular'' focal point(s) and a variation in composition for more balance, make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-07-04 21:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585189, 355368, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, good colours, beautiful blurred background.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, good colours, beautiful blurred background.', '2006-07-04 21:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585190, 356751, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this :)  Flowers in the city, repeated in the car''s tail-light.  (8)</td>', 'I like this :)  Flowers in the city, repeated in the car''s tail-light.  (8)', '2006-07-04 21:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585192, 356864, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good composition, could probably use just a bit more brightness and be a tad more sharp.</td>', 'Good composition, could probably use just a bit more brightness and be a tad more sharp.', '2006-07-04 21:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585195, 356635, 5112, '<td valign="top">Delicate yet strong, quite graphic.  Beautiful colours.  Hope you do well :)  (8)</td>', 'Delicate yet strong, quite graphic.  Beautiful colours.  Hope you do well :)  (8)', '2006-07-04 21:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585197, 356441, 5112, '<td valign="top">Greedy butterfly!  Beautiful shot.  I like the placement of the butterfly.  I''m thinking that the little bit of white petal showing at the bottom left could have been cloned out.  The image could probably use just a tad more brightness and a bit more sharpness.  (7)</td>', 'Greedy butterfly!  Beautiful shot.  I like the placement of the butterfly.  I''m thinking that the little bit of white petal showing at the bottom left could have been cloned out.  The image could probably use just a tad more brightness and a bit more sharpness.  (7)', '2006-07-04 21:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585201, 356532, 5112, '<td valign="top">Unique for this challenge.  I think it might have worked better if the hand were not cut off.  You managed to get the oranges quite bright considering the strong light.  Hope you do well :)</td>', 'Unique for this challenge.  I think it might have worked better if the hand were not cut off.  You managed to get the oranges quite bright considering the strong light.  Hope you do well :)', '2006-07-04 21:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585205, 356287, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, aren''t petunias beautiful against the light, they''re so hairy!  I think this is a rather gutsy entry.  Love the composition, and I think you managed to control the light quite well.  Good luck in the challenge :)  (8)</td>', 'Ahhh, aren''t petunias beautiful against the light, they''re so hairy!  I think this is a rather gutsy entry.  Love the composition, and I think you managed to control the light quite well.  Good luck in the challenge :)  (8)', '2006-07-04 21:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585208, 356946, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea, beautiful colours.  I think that the centred composition doesn''t work all that well here.  Maybe you can try a more to the side composition, possibly a bit less busy.  What kind of flower is this?  I don''t think I''ve ever seen one like it.  (6)</td>', 'Good idea, beautiful colours.  I think that the centred composition doesn''t work all that well here.  Maybe you can try a more to the side composition, possibly a bit less busy.  What kind of flower is this?  I don''t think I''ve ever seen one like it.  (6)', '2006-07-04 21:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585215, 355427, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea, lovely colours.  The composition looks a bit busy to me, so much going on here, the flower, the floating petals, the stem, the goldfish, the food in the water, the ripples - they''re all competing for attention.  (5)</td>', 'Good idea, lovely colours.  The composition looks a bit busy to me, so much going on here, the flower, the floating petals, the stem, the goldfish, the food in the water, the ripples - they''re all competing for attention.  (5)', '2006-07-04 21:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585218, 355059, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of DOF in my opinion!  Good light control, the colours are beautiful.  If anything, the composition might be to centred.  (7)</td>', 'Excellent choice of DOF in my opinion!  Good light control, the colours are beautiful.  If anything, the composition might be to centred.  (7)', '2006-07-04 21:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585221, 356765, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice study.  Main detractors in this image in my opinion are the background: whilst it ''suits'' the colors, doesn''t really lift the image as a whole; the ''smoothness'' (possibly pp/neat image - but apologies if wrong) - just like to see more detail in the textures, but this could be exactly as you wish it; the cropping - either finer on the right to eliminate the space between the petals, or better, including the edge of the lower petal and; the saturation, or color - <i>nice</i> as is, but the yellow just seems it needs some tweaking, hard to explain.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Nice study.  Main detractors in this image in my opinion are the background: whilst it ''suits'' the colors, doesn''t really lift the image as a whole; the ''smoothness'' (possibly pp/neat image - but apologies if wrong) - just like to see more detail in the textures, but this could be exactly as you wish it; the cropping - either finer on the right to eliminate the space between the petals, or better, including the edge of the lower petal and; the saturation, or color - nice as is, but the yellow just seems it needs some tweaking, hard to explain.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-07-04 21:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585222, 356765, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, good light, good composition.  Good "in your face" flower shot.</td>', 'Beautiful colours, good light, good composition.  Good "in your face" flower shot.', '2006-07-04 21:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585225, 356664, 5112, '<td valign="top">Like a garden dance at night!  I like it.  Hope you do well.  (8)</td>', 'Like a garden dance at night!  I like it.  Hope you do well.  (8)', '2006-07-04 21:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585229, 356986, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice.  Toning works well.  Perhaps a variation in the oof arm/''giver'' to ''show it'' a fraction more may have given this a little extra, but not sure - does work well as is in my opinion.  Nice and simple.  Perhaps the few slight distractions removed: bottom left and right, but minor.</td>', '8 - Nice.  Toning works well.  Perhaps a variation in the oof arm/''giver'' to ''show it'' a fraction more may have given this a little extra, but not sure - does work well as is in my opinion.  Nice and simple.  Perhaps the few slight distractions removed: bottom left and right, but minor.', '2006-07-04 21:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585233, 356844, 5112, '<td valign="top">So cold!  Beautiful glittery image.  (8)</td>', 'So cold!  Beautiful glittery image.  (8)', '2006-07-04 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585236, 357339, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - ''Cute'' and creative.  Wish it was a real flower.  Variation in lighting, ''base'', etc, to add to the ''fantasy'', make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - ''Cute'' and creative.  Wish it was a real flower.  Variation in lighting, ''base'', etc, to add to the ''fantasy'', make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-07-04 21:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585243, 357347, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Oh.. wow.  I wish this was bigger.  Not sure on the frame so big but... does work well.   ... very nice - want to say even <i>more</i> detail on that one stigma, but it is likely there - just the size (restrictions) doesn''t do this justice.  Color(s) - very nice.</td>', '9 - Oh.. wow.  I wish this was bigger.  Not sure on the frame so big but... does work well.   ... very nice - want to say even more detail on that one stigma, but it is likely there - just the size (restrictions) doesn''t do this justice.  Color(s) - very nice.', '2006-07-04 21:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585246, 357031, 5112, '<td valign="top">This one stands out as a thumbnail.  The orange/yellow on blue colour scheme is very effective.  I like the big white border.  Good luck in the challenge :)<br/> <br/>Back to score - 9 from me</td>', 'This one stands out as a thumbnail.  The orange/yellow on blue colour scheme is very effective.  I like the big white border.  Good luck in the challenge :) Back to score - 9 from me', '2006-07-04 21:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585252, 357209, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, very interesting.<br/> <br/>Looking at it again - this is really an interesting image.  Looks like the flower is getting lost in melting metal.  I like it quite a bit.  Upping score to 9.</td>', 'Wow, very interesting. Looking at it again - this is really an interesting image.  Looks like the flower is getting lost in melting metal.  I like it quite a bit.  Upping score to 9.', '2006-07-04 21:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585261, 356175, 5112, '<td valign="top">Gutsy title, beautiful picture :)</td>', 'Gutsy title, beautiful picture :)', '2006-07-04 21:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585266, 356262, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  Good seemingly uniform focus around, save for possibly the very fore - but fairly minor.  Perhaps just a variation in the background and composition may have given this more of an edge.</td>', '7 - Nice.  Good seemingly uniform focus around, save for possibly the very fore - but fairly minor.  Perhaps just a variation in the background and composition may have given this more of an edge.', '2006-07-04 21:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
