(2585274, 356393, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Nice colors.  Looks like it would be difficult to tweak the saturation up a little with resulting contrast issues in the white.  Nice as is though.  Perhaps just a little more empty space/soft background colors around the alien beauty within the frame ''somewhere'' (left likely) may have given this a little extra.  Sure it looks very good wall size.  Nice ''study''.  Perhaps just the sepals(?) at the fore on the right in focus too, but not sure - at any rate any change in the dof would likely diminish the soft and dreamy effect you''ve achieved, so who knows.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Nice colors.  Looks like it would be difficult to tweak the saturation up a little with resulting contrast issues in the white.  Nice as is though.  Perhaps just a little more empty space/soft background colors around the alien beauty within the frame ''somewhere'' (left likely) may have given this a little extra.  Sure it looks very good wall size.  Nice ''study''.  Perhaps just the sepals(?) at the fore on the right in focus too, but not sure - at any rate any change in the dof would likely diminish the soft and dreamy effect you''ve achieved, so who knows.', '2006-07-04 21:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585275, 356665, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, excellent clarity :)</td>', 'Wow, excellent clarity :)', '2006-07-04 21:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585280, 356741, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - This is nice, but the pruned stem dominates a little too much in my opinion.  More space at the bottom below the flower would also have likely given this a little extra.</td>', '6 - This is nice, but the pruned stem dominates a little too much in my opinion.  More space at the bottom below the flower would also have likely given this a little extra.', '2006-07-04 21:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585286, 354261, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Overall too ''processed'' in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Overall too ''processed'' in my opinion.', '2006-07-04 21:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585287, 355574, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ah, honouring Verdi.  Beautiful take.  Extremely gutsy to enter this image to a DPC Flower challenge :)  Hope you do well - I like it, could be made into a poster.  (10)</td>', 'Ah, honouring Verdi.  Beautiful take.  Extremely gutsy to enter this image to a DPC Flower challenge :)  Hope you do well - I like it, could be made into a poster.  (10)', '2006-07-04 21:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585291, 357141, 5112, '<td valign="top">Like a beautiful veil - good work.</td>', 'Like a beautiful veil - good work.', '2006-07-04 21:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585295, 355040, 5112, '<td valign="top">Zooming?  Beautiful blur, good light.  I wonder if the centred composition is the best choice for the image.</td>', 'Zooming?  Beautiful blur, good light.  I wonder if the centred composition is the best choice for the image.', '2006-07-04 21:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585296, 356664, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  Likely intentionally dark, but perhaps a fraction more light play may have given this a little extra.</td>', '7 - Nice.  Likely intentionally dark, but perhaps a fraction more light play may have given this a little extra.', '2006-07-04 21:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585303, 356193, 5112, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I really like this image.  Very cool.  The daisies on the red hair look phenomenal.  10 from me :)</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I really like this image.  Very cool.  The daisies on the red hair look phenomenal.  10 from me :)', '2006-07-04 21:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585304, 356440, 48389, '<td valign="top">Striking image, well edited, lovely detail and textures. 10</td>', 'Striking image, well edited, lovely detail and textures. 10', '2006-07-04 21:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585307, 354704, 48389, '<td valign="top">Great idea well executed, nice colours and composition :)</td>', 'Great idea well executed, nice colours and composition :)', '2006-07-04 21:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585313, 356393, 48389, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and beautiful detail :)</td>', 'Nice DOF and beautiful detail :)', '2006-07-04 21:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585314, 355488, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - so delicate, yet so strong.  Great light.  Hope you do well.  (9)</td>', 'Beautiful image - so delicate, yet so strong.  Great light.  Hope you do well.  (9)', '2006-07-04 21:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585315, 356288, 48389, '<td valign="top">really interesting flower, great detail :)</td>', 'really interesting flower, great detail :)', '2006-07-04 21:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585318, 355534, 48389, '<td valign="top">Good composition and I like the light on the flower head :)</td>', 'Good composition and I like the light on the flower head :)', '2006-07-04 21:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585322, 357144, 48389, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, nicely composed :)</td>', 'Clever idea, nicely composed :)', '2006-07-04 21:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585323, 357328, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  Perhaps a fraction dark, but likely intentional.  Difficult, but more height frame-wise, may have made this even better in my opinion - but given the size restrictions, not much to be done ''here'' - if that makes sense.  Nice title.</td>', '7 - Nice.  Perhaps a fraction dark, but likely intentional.  Difficult, but more height frame-wise, may have made this even better in my opinion - but given the size restrictions, not much to be done ''here'' - if that makes sense.  Nice title.', '2006-07-04 21:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585324, 356615, 5112, '<td valign="top">Love this shot!  Makes me want to go out for a coffee and a pastry.  Love the background.  The colours are excellent IMO.  Hope you do well.  (10)</td>', 'Love this shot!  Makes me want to go out for a coffee and a pastry.  Love the background.  The colours are excellent IMO.  Hope you do well.  (10)', '2006-07-04 21:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585326, 356887, 19944, '<td valign="top">A clever idea, well lit and well shot.</td>', 'A clever idea, well lit and well shot.', '2006-07-04 21:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585328, 356358, 48389, '<td valign="top">Amazing flower, great detail and colours. to me there is a slightly distracting ''mark'' on the petal/base of the ''red hot poker''. 8</td>', 'Amazing flower, great detail and colours. to me there is a slightly distracting ''mark'' on the petal/base of the ''red hot poker''. 8', '2006-07-04 21:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585329, 356345, 19944, '<td valign="top">great color, great light, nice &amp; sharp.  well done</td>', 'great color, great light, nice & sharp.  well done', '2006-07-04 21:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585332, 355958, 19944, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  My daughter wanted to do this (with marigolds) for the "Glass" challenge, but <strike>we</strike> she was never able to get it just right. <strike>Our</strike> Her problem was the reflections on the lightbulb.  They were nasty.  I lovethe selective desaturation.  It really adds to the photo.</td>', 'Very well done.  My daughter wanted to do this (with marigolds) for the "Glass" challenge, but we she was never able to get it just right. Our Her problem was the reflections on the lightbulb.  They were nasty.  I lovethe selective desaturation.  It really adds to the photo.', '2006-07-04 21:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585333, 353994, 19944, '<td valign="top">Oh.My.God.  This is gorgeous.  The lighting &amp; color are simply spectacular.  And the softness on the edges........<br/> <br/>I''m seeing a ribbon in your future.  Perhaps next Monday.</td>', 'Oh.My.God.  This is gorgeous.  The lighting & color are simply spectacular.  And the softness on the edges........ I''m seeing a ribbon in your future.  Perhaps next Monday.', '2006-07-04 21:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585335, 356827, 48389, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image, nicely composed and I really like the baby looking away from the camera :)</td>', 'This is a lovely image, nicely composed and I really like the baby looking away from the camera :)', '2006-07-04 21:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585336, 355484, 48389, '<td valign="top">Thats amazing!! Like the detail on the stem and the petals are something else!</td>', 'Thats amazing!! Like the detail on the stem and the petals are something else!', '2006-07-04 21:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585337, 353891, 48389, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and detail in the petals/droplets</td>', 'Nice DOF and detail in the petals/droplets', '2006-07-04 21:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585338, 357186, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Wow, nice capture.  Will be back PC to see if this was staged.  Nice and simple - just like to have seen a little more detail in the flower especially, and perhaps the bird &amp; background colors ''lifted'' - but likely near impossible with the resulting contrast issues with the white flower.  Good title.  Also, depending what you had to work with, perhaps a tighter crop at the bottom and more space included above the bird - but who knows, works very well as is.</td>', '9 - Wow, nice capture.  Will be back PC to see if this was staged.  Nice and simple - just like to have seen a little more detail in the flower especially, and perhaps the bird & background colors ''lifted'' - but likely near impossible with the resulting contrast issues with the white flower.  Good title.  Also, depending what you had to work with, perhaps a tighter crop at the bottom and more space included above the bird - but who knows, works very well as is.', '2006-07-04 21:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585339, 355619, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good use of colors and contrast and shapes.  Perhaps a variation in cropping and composition may have given this a little extra, not sure.</td>', '7 - Good use of colors and contrast and shapes.  Perhaps a variation in cropping and composition may have given this a little extra, not sure.', '2006-07-04 21:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585340, 355346, 48389, '<td valign="top">this image struck a chord with me. it made me think and I find thats one of the greatest things about photography...being able to reach into others thoughts.</td>', 'this image struck a chord with me. it made me think and I find thats one of the greatest things about photography...being able to reach into others thoughts.', '2006-07-04 21:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585341, 355471, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ah, beautiful image, great light, excellent DOF choice.  In my opinion, though, for this image to be truly excellent it would be nice if the tip of the top tulip were not cut off.  In a tight crop like this it seems odd to have one little bit cut of.  I think I would consider moving the top tulip to the right also, it looks a bit out of place where it is now.  (8)</td>', 'Ah, beautiful image, great light, excellent DOF choice.  In my opinion, though, for this image to be truly excellent it would be nice if the tip of the top tulip were not cut off.  In a tight crop like this it seems odd to have one little bit cut of.  I think I would consider moving the top tulip to the right also, it looks a bit out of place where it is now.  (8)', '2006-07-04 21:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585342, 356262, 48389, '<td valign="top">what a fantastic ''flower'', well seen :)</td>', 'what a fantastic ''flower'', well seen :)', '2006-07-04 21:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585343, 357235, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Good colours.</td>', 'Nice!  Good colours.', '2006-07-04 21:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585345, 356695, 48389, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and detail :)</td>', 'Good DOF and detail :)', '2006-07-04 21:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585347, 355636, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice and simple.  Although an obvious off-center composition, perhaps a fraction more space, especially top/top right, may have made this even better in my opinion - would also allow the sharpest focal point (which seems to be on the stigma), to take ''center stage'' more, if that makes sense.</td>', '8 - Very nice and simple.  Although an obvious off-center composition, perhaps a fraction more space, especially top/top right, may have made this even better in my opinion - would also allow the sharpest focal point (which seems to be on the stigma), to take ''center stage'' more, if that makes sense.', '2006-07-04 21:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585353, 354817, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like this, the conversion really works well and gives the petals more definition :)</td>', 'I like this, the conversion really works well and gives the petals more definition :)', '2006-07-04 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585354, 356945, 48389, '<td valign="top">Well lit, interesting flower with good colours and detail :)</td>', 'Well lit, interesting flower with good colours and detail :)', '2006-07-04 21:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585356, 356642, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ah, sunflowers!  They''re so beautiful.  (8)</td>', 'Ah, sunflowers!  They''re so beautiful.  (8)', '2006-07-04 21:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585357, 355813, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Nice composition and crop.  Main detractor in my opinion is the blown petal, which may well have been an ''in camera'' issue, hence impossible to ''repair'' in pp, apologies in advance if wrong and this is intentional.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Nice composition and crop.  Main detractor in my opinion is the blown petal, which may well have been an ''in camera'' issue, hence impossible to ''repair'' in pp, apologies in advance if wrong and this is intentional.', '2006-07-04 21:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585358, 357197, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good title for a beautiful rain flower image.  Looks delicate and strong at the same time.  Lovely composition.  (8)</td>', 'Good title for a beautiful rain flower image.  Looks delicate and strong at the same time.  Lovely composition.  (8)', '2006-07-04 21:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585361, 355464, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, beautiful bokeh!</td>', 'Beautiful colours, beautiful bokeh!', '2006-07-04 22:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585363, 356150, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice study and refractions.  Guessing this is not 640 because of quality issues, but ''if only'' it was would have been good.  The ''line''/something bottom right detracts, but fairly minor.</td>', '7 - Very nice study and refractions.  Guessing this is not 640 because of quality issues, but ''if only'' it was would have been good.  The ''line''/something bottom right detracts, but fairly minor.', '2006-07-04 22:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585369, 357097, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ah, so that''s what they''re called :)  Good closeup.</td>', 'Ah, so that''s what they''re called :)  Good closeup.', '2006-07-04 22:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585370, 357246, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  More space either side and a fraction nudge rotate up on the left, likely made this better, in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice.  More space either side and a fraction nudge rotate up on the left, likely made this better, in my opinion.', '2006-07-04 22:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585371, 356175, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.. be nicer with a different title, but your call.</td>', '7 - Very nice.. be nicer with a different title, but your call.', '2006-07-04 22:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585373, 357088, 27839, '<td valign="top">Interesting view, I like this shot.</td>', 'Interesting view, I like this shot.', '2006-07-04 22:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585374, 356715, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Really like the concept.  The darkness, bottom fore oof anthers, crop and frame all detract too much in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Really like the concept.  The darkness, bottom fore oof anthers, crop and frame all detract too much in my opinion.', '2006-07-04 22:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585376, 355918, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Bigger with a nudge rotate (what I can discern) up on the left, make this much better in my opinion.</td>', '2 - Bigger with a nudge rotate (what I can discern) up on the left, make this much better in my opinion.', '2006-07-04 22:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585377, 356640, 27839, '<td valign="top">I really like the blur in the background.  I wish the focus on the main flower was a little sharper.</td>', 'I really like the blur in the background.  I wish the focus on the main flower was a little sharper.', '2006-07-04 22:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585378, 356649, 27839, '<td valign="top">Pretty.</td>', 'Pretty.', '2006-07-04 22:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585380, 355225, 7743, '<td valign="top">As a painting I''d say this is awesome.  However, the amount of processing has eliminated any resemblance to a photograph.</td>', 'As a painting I''d say this is awesome.  However, the amount of processing has eliminated any resemblance to a photograph.', '2006-07-04 22:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585385, 357064, 27839, '<td valign="top">I love the tone of this photo.</td>', 'I love the tone of this photo.', '2006-07-04 22:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585389, 355642, 7743, '<td valign="top">The backlighting is a nice idea however I feel that a bit of front lighting is needed to light the stamen.</td>', 'The backlighting is a nice idea however I feel that a bit of front lighting is needed to light the stamen.', '2006-07-04 22:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585395, 355851, 7743, '<td valign="top">You''ve got the sharpness in the center of the flower however the chopped off stamen are a bit distracting.  Zooming out a little and using a vertical orientation may help in that regard.</td>', 'You''ve got the sharpness in the center of the flower however the chopped off stamen are a bit distracting.  Zooming out a little and using a vertical orientation may help in that regard.', '2006-07-04 22:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585409, 356715, 37730, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2006-07-04 22:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585412, 356376, 37730, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2006-07-04 22:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585426, 356635, 24981, '<td valign="top">graceful, like a ballerina... nicely done and titled :)</td>', 'graceful, like a ballerina... nicely done and titled :)', '2006-07-04 22:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585428, 356880, 24981, '<td valign="top">nice lilies, background (especially on left side) enhances the yellows. good job</td>', 'nice lilies, background (especially on left side) enhances the yellows. good job', '2006-07-04 22:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585437, 356320, 24981, '<td valign="top">this is one of the better lilies in the challenge. Very well done!</td>', 'this is one of the better lilies in the challenge. Very well done!', '2006-07-04 22:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585456, 356729, 24981, '<td valign="top">cool flowers. what kind are they? (the pink ones) -- I like they way you''ve composed this, something about it is just very nice... can''t put my finger on it though... good luck!</td>', 'cool flowers. what kind are they? (the pink ones) -- I like they way you''ve composed this, something about it is just very nice... can''t put my finger on it though... good luck!', '2006-07-04 23:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585463, 355839, 24981, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I don''t care too much for the foreground flower.</td>', 'I like this, but I don''t care too much for the foreground flower.', '2006-07-04 23:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585468, 356288, 61379, '<td valign="top">very nice background choice, like the soft shadows inside the pedals, good eye to detail.</td>', 'very nice background choice, like the soft shadows inside the pedals, good eye to detail.', '2006-07-04 23:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585469, 356340, 24981, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful. I hope this is scoring well!</td>', 'absolutely beautiful. I hope this is scoring well!', '2006-07-04 23:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585474, 355488, 61379, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, deep rich greens, soft color pedals, personally I would have choosen a different background. Good work.</td>', 'Nice photo, deep rich greens, soft color pedals, personally I would have choosen a different background. Good work.', '2006-07-04 23:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585491, 355213, 24981, '<td valign="top">interesting flowers, but the lighting seems to be a bit dark/dull, probably because they''re in shadow? The heavily blurred background is good and helps to keep the eyes on the blooms.</td>', 'interesting flowers, but the lighting seems to be a bit dark/dull, probably because they''re in shadow? The heavily blurred background is good and helps to keep the eyes on the blooms.', '2006-07-04 23:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585494, 356104, 58590, '<td valign="top">sooooo beautiful!!!!</td>', 'sooooo beautiful!!!!', '2006-07-04 23:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585496, 356807, 24981, '<td valign="top">good take on a well-established concept.</td>', 'good take on a well-established concept.', '2006-07-04 23:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585498, 353994, 58590, '<td valign="top">Simply Gorgeous</td>', 'Simply Gorgeous', '2006-07-04 23:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585501, 356393, 59130, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite entry - it is beautiful but not the usual cliched flower picture!  The shape is interesting, I love the DOF you''ve used, I like the crop (i.e. slightly off-centre but without too much negative space).  Very well done indeed - hope you get the blue ribbon.</td>', 'This is my favourite entry - it is beautiful but not the usual cliched flower picture!  The shape is interesting, I love the DOF you''ve used, I like the crop (i.e. slightly off-centre but without too much negative space).  Very well done indeed - hope you get the blue ribbon.', '2006-07-04 23:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585502, 357179, 24981, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the greens are great, but the lighting on the flower seems on the flat side.</td>', 'I like the composition, the greens are great, but the lighting on the flower seems on the flat side.', '2006-07-04 23:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585504, 356411, 59130, '<td valign="top">This is great - very unusual looking and beautiful in an under-stated way.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'This is great - very unusual looking and beautiful in an under-stated way.  One of my favourites.', '2006-07-04 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585507, 354046, 59130, '<td valign="top">Love it.  My only criticism is that the petals in the bottom right appear slightly over-sharpened - I guess if you''d have lessened it you would have lost sharpness over the rest of the flower though.  One of my favourite shots in the challenge.</td>', 'Love it.  My only criticism is that the petals in the bottom right appear slightly over-sharpened - I guess if you''d have lessened it you would have lost sharpness over the rest of the flower though.  One of my favourite shots in the challenge.', '2006-07-04 23:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585508, 356041, 24981, '<td valign="top">I think this is nicely done. The lighting is good (IMO) and the background does well to enhance the foreground flower. Nice touch to add the out of focus flower in the background too. :)</td>', 'I think this is nicely done. The lighting is good (IMO) and the background does well to enhance the foreground flower. Nice touch to add the out of focus flower in the background too. :)', '2006-07-04 23:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585509, 356613, 59130, '<td valign="top">So simple, and so beautiful.  One of my favourites in the challenge.  I can''t think of anything bad to say about it!</td>', 'So simple, and so beautiful.  One of my favourites in the challenge.  I can''t think of anything bad to say about it!', '2006-07-04 23:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585510, 356642, 59130, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - one of my favourites.</td>', 'Lovely shot - one of my favourites.', '2006-07-04 23:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585511, 356193, 59130, '<td valign="top">Well done for being a bit different!  I really like this, and in my opinion this is better than the other similar shot in the challenge.</td>', 'Well done for being a bit different!  I really like this, and in my opinion this is better than the other similar shot in the challenge.', '2006-07-04 23:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585514, 356031, 59130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - love the shapes and colours.  One of my favourites in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful - love the shapes and colours.  One of my favourites in the challenge.', '2006-07-04 23:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585516, 355958, 45596, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your originality.</td>', 'Thanks for your originality.', '2006-07-04 23:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585520, 357166, 45596, '<td valign="top">Good photo...has a lot of potential.  Keep pushing the envelope.  :-)</td>', 'Good photo...has a lot of potential.  Keep pushing the envelope.  :-)', '2006-07-04 23:37:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2585524, 356287, 45596, '<td valign="top">Technically, it''s a good photo, but it just doesn''t do anything for me.  Sorry.</td>', 'Technically, it''s a good photo, but it just doesn''t do anything for me.  Sorry.', '2006-07-04 23:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585528, 357342, 45596, '<td valign="top">The challenge is "Flowers"...this photo would be perfect for "Insects" or something similar.</td>', 'The challenge is "Flowers"...this photo would be perfect for "Insects" or something similar.', '2006-07-04 23:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585530, 356947, 45596, '<td valign="top">A very good photo...I wish there were something more unique in it...something that would make it stand out above all the other flower photos.</td>', 'A very good photo...I wish there were something more unique in it...something that would make it stand out above all the other flower photos.', '2006-07-04 23:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585532, 355574, 24981, '<td valign="top">not sure what the purpose of the animal in the background is, I think it''d look better with more of the same background that surrounds the dropped flowers instead. If you were trying to make it appear that the animal knocked over the flowerpot, then I can understand why it''s in the shot. anyway, good luck!</td>', 'not sure what the purpose of the animal in the background is, I think it''d look better with more of the same background that surrounds the dropped flowers instead. If you were trying to make it appear that the animal knocked over the flowerpot, then I can understand why it''s in the shot. anyway, good luck!', '2006-07-04 23:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585535, 354794, 24981, '<td valign="top">cute puppy. It looks like you''ve placed the flower in front of a picture of the puppy. Am I right? nice concept. good luck</td>', 'cute puppy. It looks like you''ve placed the flower in front of a picture of the puppy. Am I right? nice concept. good luck', '2006-07-04 23:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585536, 356483, 45596, '<td valign="top">I recommend a sharper focus.  Furthermore, a border color of red, blue, or green.</td>', 'I recommend a sharper focus.  Furthermore, a border color of red, blue, or green.', '2006-07-04 23:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585539, 355225, 45596, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the colors, and your "out of box" thinking.  Congrats.</td>', 'I enjoy the colors, and your "out of box" thinking.  Congrats.', '2006-07-04 23:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585542, 355992, 60242, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2006-07-04 23:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2585543, 356376, 24981, '<td valign="top">is the white really petals? It looks like silk. very nicely done</td>', 'is the white really petals? It looks like silk. very nicely done', '2006-07-04 23:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
