(2588126, 356533, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea, although I think in this case the shallow DOF works against you, as it draws way too much attention to the one petal in front.  The image looks quite a bit oversharpened.  I also wonder, the title, "Softly Softly", the image doesn''t really look soft, looks strong instead.  The background is beautiful.</td>', 'Good idea, although I think in this case the shallow DOF works against you, as it draws way too much attention to the one petal in front.  The image looks quite a bit oversharpened.  I also wonder, the title, "Softly Softly", the image doesn''t really look soft, looks strong instead.  The background is beautiful.', '2006-07-05 14:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2588127, 357097, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great textures, composition, color and interesting abstract vibe coming from this.  It''s really very alien-like which makes it just a tad scary ... which is good of course.</td>', 'Great textures, composition, color and interesting abstract vibe coming from this.  It''s really very alien-like which makes it just a tad scary ... which is good of course.', '2006-07-05 14:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
