(2588171, 355936, 38032, '<td valign="top">Kinda surreal looking color ... cartoonish in some way .. i can''t put a finger on it but it''s cool.</td>', 'Kinda surreal looking color ... cartoonish in some way .. i can''t put a finger on it but it''s cool.', '2006-07-05 14:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2588176, 357235, 22288, '<td valign="top">Wow, that really pops. A little soft on some of the petals. 7</td>', 'Wow, that really pops. A little soft on some of the petals. 7', '2006-07-05 14:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2588185, 354817, 38032, '<td valign="top">Never heard of ''em ... Anyway, about the image :] ... The grainy bits on the petals definitely make these look like a gritty statue ... the contrast between the normally soft petals and the new-found texture found in the photo is very interesting and should prove positive among voters, I would think. 8</td>', 'Never heard of ''em ... Anyway, about the image :] ... The grainy bits on the petals definitely make these look like a gritty statue ... the contrast between the normally soft petals and the new-found texture found in the photo is very interesting and should prove positive among voters, I would think. 8', '2006-07-05 14:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
