(2589415, 356843, 42792, '<td valign="top">For some reason this reminds me of a large renaissance oil canvas.  Rather beautiful and very original. Bumping up. And yet again! :)</td>', 'For some reason this reminds me of a large renaissance oil canvas.  Rather beautiful and very original. Bumping up. And yet again! :)', '2006-07-05 18:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589417, 357002, 55738, '<td valign="top">Great use of your background to mimic your foreground.  I just wish the foreground was a tough sharper.</td>', 'Great use of your background to mimic your foreground.  I just wish the foreground was a tough sharper.', '2006-07-05 18:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589418, 356358, 55738, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF and pin sharp detail.  Great reds too!</td>', 'Excellent DOF and pin sharp detail.  Great reds too!', '2006-07-05 18:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589421, 356440, 42792, '<td valign="top">Like this.  The fabric is a wonderful replica and contrast to the rose.  Bumping up for the artistic idea.</td>', 'Like this.  The fabric is a wonderful replica and contrast to the rose.  Bumping up for the artistic idea.', '2006-07-05 18:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589423, 355620, 55738, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the selective coloring works for me here.  It makes it look really overprocessed. Maybe if the rest of it had not been completely desaturated it would work better.</td>', 'I''m not sure the selective coloring works for me here.  It makes it look really overprocessed. Maybe if the rest of it had not been completely desaturated it would work better.', '2006-07-05 18:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589425, 355861, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting, but I''m not in love with the fact that the yellow halos the flower a bit.  It makes it look too processed for my taste.</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting, but I''m not in love with the fact that the yellow halos the flower a bit.  It makes it look too processed for my taste.', '2006-07-05 18:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589432, 356842, 55738, '<td valign="top">pretty multi petaled lily and nice colors.  The composition isn''t very exciting though.  With all those petals try an off center composition or a different perspective to use their implied movement to your advantage.</td>', 'pretty multi petaled lily and nice colors.  The composition isn''t very exciting though.  With all those petals try an off center composition or a different perspective to use their implied movement to your advantage.', '2006-07-05 18:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589435, 355505, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition.  If the white is a cloud, that works, but it looks a little too much like it was added in post processing.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition.  If the white is a cloud, that works, but it looks a little too much like it was added in post processing.', '2006-07-05 18:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589437, 356340, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition with gorgeous color.</td>', 'Nice simple composition with gorgeous color.', '2006-07-05 18:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589442, 356851, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - There''s a magnificent passion flower there in the background...</td>', '2 - There''s a magnificent passion flower there in the background...', '2006-07-05 18:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589443, 357284, 42792, '<td valign="top">A beautiful study on textures.</td>', 'A beautiful study on textures.', '2006-07-05 18:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589447, 356455, 55738, '<td valign="top">The details in the model really distract me.  The eye makeup is not very well done, the necklace is incongruous and the top is a strange color for the composition. Sorry.</td>', 'The details in the model really distract me.  The eye makeup is not very well done, the necklace is incongruous and the top is a strange color for the composition. Sorry.', '2006-07-05 18:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589452, 355408, 55738, '<td valign="top">pretty details and a nice alternative to a wide open flower.</td>', 'pretty details and a nice alternative to a wide open flower.', '2006-07-05 18:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589455, 357202, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the soft colors, but I don''t like the noise.  Sorry.</td>', 'I like the soft colors, but I don''t like the noise.  Sorry.', '2006-07-05 18:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589457, 356649, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is pretty lighting, but it looks a bit like the lightbeam was added in post.  I don''t like that part very well.  Sorry.</td>', 'This is pretty lighting, but it looks a bit like the lightbeam was added in post.  I don''t like that part very well.  Sorry.', '2006-07-05 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589459, 354629, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice use of background to make the flower really stand out.</td>', 'Nice use of background to make the flower really stand out.', '2006-07-05 18:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589461, 356848, 55738, '<td valign="top">I wish the flowers had been a little crisper.</td>', 'I wish the flowers had been a little crisper.', '2006-07-05 18:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589465, 354706, 55738, '<td valign="top">the background is really distracting in this one. I think a darker background or one that is more uniform would work better to not compete with the flower for attention.</td>', 'the background is really distracting in this one. I think a darker background or one that is more uniform would work better to not compete with the flower for attention.', '2006-07-05 18:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589470, 357031, 42792, '<td valign="top">Lovely!!!  A bit of detail lost in the dark corner but 8 anyway.</td>', 'Lovely!!!  A bit of detail lost in the dark corner but 8 anyway.', '2006-07-05 18:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589471, 356875, 55738, '<td valign="top">These are nice colors, but the composition doesn''t really do much for it.  Sorry.  I like the grasses on the left.  Maybe more of those, or a less tight shot would work better.</td>', 'These are nice colors, but the composition doesn''t really do much for it.  Sorry.  I like the grasses on the left.  Maybe more of those, or a less tight shot would work better.', '2006-07-05 18:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589474, 357179, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition.  And good sharp petals.</td>', 'Nice simple composition.  And good sharp petals.', '2006-07-05 18:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589478, 357163, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like this abstract.  I don''t think many will, but I find it very nice.  Excellent!</td>', 'I like this abstract.  I don''t think many will, but I find it very nice.  Excellent!', '2006-07-05 18:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589485, 357197, 55738, '<td valign="top">Pretty color!  The focus is pretty much just where it should be.  I''d almost like a tad more sharpness.</td>', 'Pretty color!  The focus is pretty much just where it should be.  I''d almost like a tad more sharpness.', '2006-07-05 18:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589487, 354817, 55738, '<td valign="top">You certainly have captured that texture.  Nice work.</td>', 'You certainly have captured that texture.  Nice work.', '2006-07-05 18:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589489, 356199, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice background use.  And the flowers are nicely focused.</td>', 'Nice background use.  And the flowers are nicely focused.', '2006-07-05 18:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589491, 357294, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, though I find it a little too dark at the top.  It''s moody and I like that, but maybe just a little more light?</td>', 'I like the composition, though I find it a little too dark at the top.  It''s moody and I like that, but maybe just a little more light?', '2006-07-05 19:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589494, 355853, 55738, '<td valign="top">The color is nice, but the composition is lacking.  Maybe a little more context for the dark spots would be good.</td>', 'The color is nice, but the composition is lacking.  Maybe a little more context for the dark spots would be good.', '2006-07-05 19:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589496, 356406, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice color and soft light.</td>', 'Nice color and soft light.', '2006-07-05 19:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589497, 357005, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice study of the shapes and colors.  A more refined crop make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice study of the shapes and colors.  A more refined crop make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-07-05 19:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589498, 356796, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the model looks terribly bored and that really detracts from it for me.  I''m also not in love with the way the light falls off on the top.  You''ve used nice colors though.</td>', 'I like the concept, but the model looks terribly bored and that really detracts from it for me.  I''m also not in love with the way the light falls off on the top.  You''ve used nice colors though.', '2006-07-05 19:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589502, 356937, 55738, '<td valign="top">The flowers need to be in better focus.  Sorry.</td>', 'The flowers need to be in better focus.  Sorry.', '2006-07-05 19:02:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2589504, 355923, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I like that you didn''t desaturate and got what a lot of people are desaturating to achieve.</td>', 'This is nice.  I like that you didn''t desaturate and got what a lot of people are desaturating to achieve.', '2006-07-05 19:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589505, 356262, 55738, '<td valign="top">Great sense of motion.</td>', 'Great sense of motion.', '2006-07-05 19:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589508, 355849, 55738, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the color here.  The composition is nice, but the color doesn''t move me.  Sorry.</td>', 'I don''t really like the color here.  The composition is nice, but the color doesn''t move me.  Sorry.', '2006-07-05 19:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589515, 356356, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is pretty, but the contrast is a bit too high.  I want just a little more detail in the rose''s head.  The composition and idea are great though.</td>', 'This is pretty, but the contrast is a bit too high.  I want just a little more detail in the rose''s head.  The composition and idea are great though.', '2006-07-05 19:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589517, 356715, 55738, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This looks creepy.  I''m not sure what is supposed to be in focus, but I love the lighting.  Neat shot.</td>', 'Wow.  This looks creepy.  I''m not sure what is supposed to be in focus, but I love the lighting.  Neat shot.', '2006-07-05 19:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589519, 356441, 55738, '<td valign="top">Very nice soft colors.</td>', 'Very nice soft colors.', '2006-07-05 19:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589520, 355250, 42792, '<td valign="top">Rather busy composition with overly saturated colours but they seem to work pretty well.  Comes together quite nicely with the vibrant colours and bokeh.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Rather busy composition with overly saturated colours but they seem to work pretty well.  Comes together quite nicely with the vibrant colours and bokeh.  Bumping up.', '2006-07-05 19:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589522, 356376, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the repetition of folded petals.  It makes for the impression that its petals go on and on. I wish for just a little more light on the yellow though.</td>', 'I like the repetition of folded petals.  It makes for the impression that its petals go on and on. I wish for just a little more light on the yellow though.', '2006-07-05 19:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589524, 356587, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice background use.  Great lighting.</td>', 'Nice background use.  Great lighting.', '2006-07-05 19:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589527, 357159, 55738, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Those really stand out.  They feel a little oversaturated , but they''re pretty.</td>', 'Wow.  Those really stand out.  They feel a little oversaturated , but they''re pretty.', '2006-07-05 19:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589529, 355122, 55738, '<td valign="top">great composition!</td>', 'great composition!', '2006-07-05 19:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589533, 356721, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Simple and clear.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Simple and clear.', '2006-07-05 19:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589535, 355464, 55738, '<td valign="top">this is nice.  These are hard to shoot, I''ve tried and mostly failed.  You''ve done well.</td>', 'this is nice.  These are hard to shoot, I''ve tried and mostly failed.  You''ve done well.', '2006-07-05 19:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589537, 355346, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is too overprocessed for my taste.  Sorry.</td>', 'This is too overprocessed for my taste.  Sorry.', '2006-07-05 19:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589542, 356754, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is cute, I keep going back and forth on whether I think it meets the challenge.  The flower is out of focus and not the focal point of the camera, but it is the focal point of the girl''s gaze.  I''m unsure.  It''s a nice shot though.</td>', 'This is cute, I keep going back and forth on whether I think it meets the challenge.  The flower is out of focus and not the focal point of the camera, but it is the focal point of the girl''s gaze.  I''m unsure.  It''s a nice shot though.', '2006-07-05 19:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589543, 357362, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice color and capturing of the texture of this.</td>', 'Nice color and capturing of the texture of this.', '2006-07-05 19:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589546, 356532, 55738, '<td valign="top">I wish the arm had blocked the sun a little more.  I think that would have made the flowers stand out better.</td>', 'I wish the arm had blocked the sun a little more.  I think that would have made the flowers stand out better.', '2006-07-05 19:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589547, 356372, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color!</td>', 'Nice composition and color!', '2006-07-05 19:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589550, 357265, 55738, '<td valign="top">The background is neat.  It works for this, though I''m sure some will think it too distracting since the flowers are so dark.  But somehow, even though it shouldn''t, I think it works.</td>', 'The background is neat.  It works for this, though I''m sure some will think it too distracting since the flowers are so dark.  But somehow, even though it shouldn''t, I think it works.', '2006-07-05 19:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589553, 356175, 55738, '<td valign="top">Simple and pretty.  Though the title kind of is silly.  Sorry. (I''m not voting no that I assure you!)  :)</td>', 'Simple and pretty.  Though the title kind of is silly.  Sorry. (I''m not voting no that I assure you!)  :)', '2006-07-05 19:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589555, 355519, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the background in contrast to the flowers, but the flowers could use a little more light on them.</td>', 'I like the color of the background in contrast to the flowers, but the flowers could use a little more light on them.', '2006-07-05 19:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589556, 357064, 55738, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color choice.</td>', 'Nice composition and color choice.', '2006-07-05 19:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589558, 355583, 55738, '<td valign="top">I wish for a little more sharpness here.  Sorry.</td>', 'I wish for a little more sharpness here.  Sorry.', '2006-07-05 19:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589560, 354794, 55738, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.</td>', 'Cute shot.', '2006-07-05 19:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589563, 356253, 55738, '<td valign="top">Good light and color.  I''m not in love with the composition though.  I think with the water on it detracts from the delicacy of the bubbles and flowers.</td>', 'Good light and color.  I''m not in love with the composition though.  I think with the water on it detracts from the delicacy of the bubbles and flowers.', '2006-07-05 19:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
