(2589648, 357075, 55738, '<td valign="top">The colors are far too saturated for my taste.  The contrast is also too high.  sorry.</td>', 'The colors are far too saturated for my taste.  The contrast is also too high.  sorry.', '2006-07-05 19:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
