(2589653, 357101, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice composition and simplicity.  Like the detail in the buds.  ''If only'' a little more detail and lighting/brightness on the open flower, make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Very nice composition and simplicity.  Like the detail in the buds.  ''If only'' a little more detail and lighting/brightness on the open flower, make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-07-05 19:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
