(2593439, 357162, 55738, '<td valign="top">cute shot.  The excess light on the backdrop is something I can''t decide if I like or not.  At first I don''t, but then I look at it more trying to decide why I don''t and I can''t come up with a good reason, so maybe I do!  One thing that it does do is draw the eye from the flowers since it''s brighter.  I''m not sure that''s what you want it to do.</td>', 'cute shot.  The excess light on the backdrop is something I can''t decide if I like or not.  At first I don''t, but then I look at it more trying to decide why I don''t and I can''t come up with a good reason, so maybe I do!  One thing that it does do is draw the eye from the flowers since it''s brighter.  I''m not sure that''s what you want it to do.', '2006-07-06 14:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593441, 357004, 55738, '<td valign="top">You''ve achieved a nice old look here.</td>', 'You''ve achieved a nice old look here.', '2006-07-06 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
