(2593450, 356571, 55738, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That''s a crazy background!  I can''t tell if it''s too busy or not.  It does detract a little from the flower, but since the flower is busy too, it might just work.</td>', 'Wow.  That''s a crazy background!  I can''t tell if it''s too busy or not.  It does detract a little from the flower, but since the flower is busy too, it might just work.', '2006-07-06 14:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
