(2595581, 357169, 42495, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what kind of flower this is but it looks great in the portrait view with darker background.  This would have probably done well in Bokeh II.  Cropping off the bright white in upper right may help keep the focus on the flower.</td>', 'I''m not sure what kind of flower this is but it looks great in the portrait view with darker background.  This would have probably done well in Bokeh II.  Cropping off the bright white in upper right may help keep the focus on the flower.', '2006-07-07 00:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
