(2595929, 355816, 25678, '<td valign="top">How much eyelash glue did that take?!  Creative take on this challenge.  Nit pick thing is there are some highlights that seem blown out on her hair, and I find the dark eyeliner a bit distracting.  It takes away from the idea of petals as lashes</td>', 'How much eyelash glue did that take?!  Creative take on this challenge.  Nit pick thing is there are some highlights that seem blown out on her hair, and I find the dark eyeliner a bit distracting.  It takes away from the idea of petals as lashes', '2006-07-07 03:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
