(2600478, 356262, 15032, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite ''subjects'' in the flower challenge!  I think it could have had more ''pop'' if the green leaves in the background were not there though, 7.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite ''subjects'' in the flower challenge!  I think it could have had more ''pop'' if the green leaves in the background were not there though, 7.', '2006-07-08 13:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
