(2601198, 356428, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness of this shot. The droplets look great, and the blue/yellow complementary colors are strong. The composition feels a little static; maybe bringing the subject to fill more of the frame would help.</td>', 'I like the darkness of this shot. The droplets look great, and the blue/yellow complementary colors are strong. The composition feels a little static; maybe bringing the subject to fill more of the frame would help.', '2006-07-08 19:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
