(2601232, 355816, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this unique concept for a flower challenge. The lighting is really nice and smooth, and the focus is great. I''m not sure I like the color green for the background.. maybe a baby blue or pastel purple would work well too. The composition and pose is great, and the catchlights in her eyes look good.</td>', 'I like this unique concept for a flower challenge. The lighting is really nice and smooth, and the focus is great. I''m not sure I like the color green for the background.. maybe a baby blue or pastel purple would work well too. The composition and pose is great, and the catchlights in her eyes look good.', '2006-07-08 19:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2601240, 357209, 27767, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I like the composition and the colors. I also like the swirling and mixing orange/green liquids for a background. It looks like the DOF may have been a little too shallow to keep all the petals and stamen in focus.</td>', 'Interesting concept. I like the composition and the colors. I also like the swirling and mixing orange/green liquids for a background. It looks like the DOF may have been a little too shallow to keep all the petals and stamen in focus.', '2006-07-08 19:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
