(2602289, 356844, 40912, '<td valign="top">Wow.. This looks like a gem of some sort. Is it underwater? Very nice.</td>', 'Wow.. This looks like a gem of some sort. Is it underwater? Very nice.', '2006-07-09 01:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602297, 357147, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your picture is oof and the subject is cut off on the right side. I think in this case it would of been better to center the subject so the subject would be in full view.<br/>Wish you will in this and future challenges.</td>', 'Your picture is oof and the subject is cut off on the right side. I think in this case it would of been better to center the subject so the subject would be in full view.Wish you will in this and future challenges.', '2006-07-09 01:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602302, 355721, 22970, '<td valign="top">I wish you would of had a deeper DOF so all the petals of the flower would of been in focus. The background being very close in tone takes away from the flowers color power. <br/>Wish you well in this and future challenges.</td>', 'I wish you would of had a deeper DOF so all the petals of the flower would of been in focus. The background being very close in tone takes away from the flowers color power. Wish you well in this and future challenges.', '2006-07-09 01:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602304, 355694, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good color and focus. A little deeper DOF would of been nicer IMO. Nice lighting but the background of straw (lines) are some what distracting.</td>', 'Good color and focus. A little deeper DOF would of been nicer IMO. Nice lighting but the background of straw (lines) are some what distracting.', '2006-07-09 01:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602311, 356406, 22970, '<td valign="top">You subject lacks the detail needed to make it stand out and the brown petals to the lower left is very distracting. The photograph it self looks very soft overall. I wish you the best in this and future challenges.</td>', 'You subject lacks the detail needed to make it stand out and the brown petals to the lower left is very distracting. The photograph it self looks very soft overall. I wish you the best in this and future challenges.', '2006-07-09 02:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602314, 355504, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice processing but not sure about other elements. Looks like a Bible to the right bottom. Not enough of it in the frame to tell me the story why it''s there making me keep looking at It instead of the flowers.<br/> <br/>Overall good picture, a little soft on the flowers but good.</td>', 'Nice processing but not sure about other elements. Looks like a Bible to the right bottom. Not enough of it in the frame to tell me the story why it''s there making me keep looking at It instead of the flowers. Overall good picture, a little soft on the flowers but good.', '2006-07-09 02:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602315, 357319, 58906, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract effect of the light.  Very different and artistic.  Well done!</td>', 'I like the abstract effect of the light.  Very different and artistic.  Well done!', '2006-07-09 02:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602317, 355923, 58906, '<td valign="top">Not the average entry in this challenge.  I like this alot.</td>', 'Not the average entry in this challenge.  I like this alot.', '2006-07-09 02:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602319, 356507, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice overall picture. Good tone, not over done or under exposed. Focus point exactly where it needs to be with a DOF that still lets the viewer know the subject surroundings. Pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Nice overall picture. Good tone, not over done or under exposed. Focus point exactly where it needs to be with a DOF that still lets the viewer know the subject surroundings. Pleasing to the eye.', '2006-07-09 02:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602333, 357127, 58906, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and use of complimentary natural blue background.  I like it.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice lighting and use of complimentary natural blue background.  I like it.  Well done!', '2006-07-09 02:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602340, 355958, 22970, '<td valign="top">I maybe going against what some may be saying but I know you would want my honest opinion. You had a good idea here but I think it fell a little short. One thing that is distracting to me is the selective desaturation. You have destaturated the green of the leafs but a few around the flowers retained its color. The flowers themselves offer very little detail with dark centers that distracts me. The layout of the your subject in the bulb is leaning all to the right giving me an allusion that the bulb is not symmetrical.<br/> <br/>The focus is good along with the lighting. Maybe it''s just me but the processing did little or anything to enhance this photograph especially when comparing it to the title to try to arrive at a connection. The background is nice and even and the DOF is good.<br/> <br/>I think this could be a great photograph executed properly.</td>', 'I maybe going against what some may be saying but I know you would want my honest opinion. You had a good idea here but I think it fell a little short. One thing that is distracting to me is the selective desaturation. You have destaturated the green of the leafs but a few around the flowers retained its color. The flowers themselves offer very little detail with dark centers that distracts me. The layout of the your subject in the bulb is leaning all to the right giving me an allusion that the bulb is not symmetrical. The focus is good along with the lighting. Maybe it''s just me but the processing did little or anything to enhance this photograph especially when comparing it to the title to try to arrive at a connection. The background is nice and even and the DOF is good. I think this could be a great photograph executed properly.', '2006-07-09 02:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602341, 357255, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, lighting, and DOF. Very natural looking</td>', 'Nice focus, lighting, and DOF. Very natural looking', '2006-07-09 02:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602363, 357186, 58906, '<td valign="top">My choice for a sure ribbon winner.  Great shot.  Good luck!</td>', 'My choice for a sure ribbon winner.  Great shot.  Good luck!', '2006-07-09 02:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
