(2604798, 357005, 58868, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, nice angle.</td>', 'I really like this shot, nice angle.', '2006-07-09 23:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604805, 356822, 58868, '<td valign="top">excellent composition!</td>', 'excellent composition!', '2006-07-09 23:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604834, 356392, 58868, '<td valign="top">I really like the flower and the shot, but there is a bit too much light.  Maybe that was your intention, im not sure. Nice shot.</td>', 'I really like the flower and the shot, but there is a bit too much light.  Maybe that was your intention, im not sure. Nice shot.', '2006-07-10 00:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604838, 356843, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very erotic.</td>', 'Very erotic.', '2006-07-10 00:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604842, 357242, 58868, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective!</td>', 'Very nice perspective!', '2006-07-10 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604854, 354046, 58868, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.  Very sharp, and rich in color.</td>', 'beautiful shot.  Very sharp, and rich in color.', '2006-07-10 00:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604856, 356860, 4321, '<td valign="top">I like that this is so different from the others</td>', 'I like that this is so different from the others', '2006-07-10 00:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604858, 355918, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think the idea for this is great, but some impact and detail is lost because of it''s smaller size. It looks like the lighting is ok and not too harsh. The colors up close are good, but get a little washed out in the background. The DOF is good if the intention was to keep everything in focus. One thing that I think would help this shot a lot is an obvious primary subject to act as a focal point.</td>', 'I think the idea for this is great, but some impact and detail is lost because of it''s smaller size. It looks like the lighting is ok and not too harsh. The colors up close are good, but get a little washed out in the background. The DOF is good if the intention was to keep everything in focus. One thing that I think would help this shot a lot is an obvious primary subject to act as a focal point.', '2006-07-10 00:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604868, 356887, 58868, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea, I like it a lot</td>', 'Very cool idea, I like it a lot', '2006-07-10 00:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604872, 355630, 27767, '<td valign="top">The choice of focus and DOF in this shot makes the closest and out-of-focus flower rather distracting to me. I would actually prefer the close flower to be in focus, then let the background wash out into a soft backdrop. The good even lighting works well for this type of subject though.</td>', 'The choice of focus and DOF in this shot makes the closest and out-of-focus flower rather distracting to me. I would actually prefer the close flower to be in focus, then let the background wash out into a soft backdrop. The good even lighting works well for this type of subject though.', '2006-07-10 00:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604873, 356340, 58868, '<td valign="top">this is such a great shot, I just love it!</td>', 'this is such a great shot, I just love it!', '2006-07-10 00:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604881, 355823, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think the concept for this shot is excellent, but so much detail is lost in the flowers and petals that it looses some impact for me. I think the sepia toning looks good here though.</td>', 'I think the concept for this shot is excellent, but so much detail is lost in the flowers and petals that it looses some impact for me. I think the sepia toning looks good here though.', '2006-07-10 00:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604889, 356823, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very interesting selection of flower for this contest. I think it has great potential because of all the interesting details. The lighting for this shot is a little too harsh for my liking. I think that getting rid of all the shadows and moving in closer to capture the detail of just a few flowers would give more impact.</td>', 'Very interesting selection of flower for this contest. I think it has great potential because of all the interesting details. The lighting for this shot is a little too harsh for my liking. I think that getting rid of all the shadows and moving in closer to capture the detail of just a few flowers would give more impact.', '2006-07-10 00:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604894, 357284, 36371, '<td valign="top">Very  powerful image. Nicely done! 10</td>', 'Very  powerful image. Nicely done! 10', '2006-07-10 00:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604901, 357186, 32033, '<td valign="top">is that a REAL bird?</td>', 'is that a REAL bird?', '2006-07-10 00:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604903, 356041, 28742, '<td valign="top">Oh man - you should have titled this "Giraffes" they totally look like them. That cost you a bonus point. ;-)</td>', 'Oh man - you should have titled this "Giraffes" they totally look like them. That cost you a bonus point. ;-)', '2006-07-10 00:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604905, 356338, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of a subject lit and leaving the background totally dark. The shadows here make the shot seem a little busy. The DOF also seems to be really shallow, so only some of the petals are in focus. I would actually prefer this type of shot to have deeper DOF so the whole flower is in focus since blurring the background makes no difference because it is black.</td>', 'I like the idea of a subject lit and leaving the background totally dark. The shadows here make the shot seem a little busy. The DOF also seems to be really shallow, so only some of the petals are in focus. I would actually prefer this type of shot to have deeper DOF so the whole flower is in focus since blurring the background makes no difference because it is black.', '2006-07-10 00:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604915, 357075, 27767, '<td valign="top">Pretty display of flowers, though the blown out highlights detract from the beauty for me. The composition is nice, and the background is ok. I wish the lighting wasn''t so harsh because the dark shadows and bright highlights remove a good amount of interesting details from the subject.</td>', 'Pretty display of flowers, though the blown out highlights detract from the beauty for me. The composition is nice, and the background is ok. I wish the lighting wasn''t so harsh because the dark shadows and bright highlights remove a good amount of interesting details from the subject.', '2006-07-10 00:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604916, 356328, 28742, '<td valign="top">...or "Daisy in a Police Lineup" ;-P <br/>Number one, turn to the left. :)</td>', '...or "Daisy in a Police Lineup" ;-P Number one, turn to the left. :)', '2006-07-10 00:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604922, 356741, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good focus to bring out the details in the petals. The stalk on the left side is a little distracting to me since it competes with the primary subject for attention. The soft lighting works quite well for this subject.</td>', 'Good focus to bring out the details in the petals. The stalk on the left side is a little distracting to me since it competes with the primary subject for attention. The soft lighting works quite well for this subject.', '2006-07-10 00:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604932, 355346, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the diffuse look to this shot (a diffusion filter?) and the lighting. The composition feels a little off balance to me though. I think the colors are ok and the focus looks fine too.</td>', 'I like the diffuse look to this shot (a diffusion filter?) and the lighting. The composition feels a little off balance to me though. I think the colors are ok and the focus looks fine too.', '2006-07-10 00:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2604941, 356693, 27767, '<td valign="top">The flowers are pretty, but it seems the colors are super-saturated which makes them look a little unnatural. The composition is good. I wish the DOF were a little more shallow so the background washed into soft colors.</td>', 'The flowers are pretty, but it seems the colors are super-saturated which makes them look a little unnatural. The composition is good. I wish the DOF were a little more shallow so the background washed into soft colors.', '2006-07-10 00:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605009, 355894, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think the backlighting really makes this shot unique. At first I couldn''t quite make out the bee, but now I find it interesting. The shot feels overall a little busy to me. Maybe zooming in a little on the center of the shot would bring more focus and detail to the primary subjects.</td>', 'I think the backlighting really makes this shot unique. At first I couldn''t quite make out the bee, but now I find it interesting. The shot feels overall a little busy to me. Maybe zooming in a little on the center of the shot would bring more focus and detail to the primary subjects.', '2006-07-10 00:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605024, 355642, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the idea for this shot a lot. The backlighting on this flower really brings out some great colors.</td>', 'I like the idea for this shot a lot. The backlighting on this flower really brings out some great colors.', '2006-07-10 00:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605027, 357162, 5112, '<td valign="top">I suppose you got this comment, but here it is again, "Funny!"<br/> <br/>Actually, I think you did this one quite well.  Love the two shadows.  (8)</td>', 'I suppose you got this comment, but here it is again, "Funny!" Actually, I think you did this one quite well.  Love the two shadows.  (8)', '2006-07-10 00:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605031, 357078, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The sunflower looks like she''s crying.  Love the background.  (8)</td>', 'I like this.  The sunflower looks like she''s crying.  Love the background.  (8)', '2006-07-10 00:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605035, 357339, 5112, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  :)</td>', 'Too funny!  :)', '2006-07-10 00:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605037, 355851, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very interesting choice of flower. I think the colors are great. The main thing that bothers me is the crop. The tops of the stamen are cut off which makes it feel a little incomplete.  I would like the shot either cropped much closer, or composed to include the full stamen and pistol.</td>', 'Very interesting choice of flower. I think the colors are great. The main thing that bothers me is the crop. The tops of the stamen are cut off which makes it feel a little incomplete.  I would like the shot either cropped much closer, or composed to include the full stamen and pistol.', '2006-07-10 00:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605042, 357186, 58438, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful.  What a shot!  Nothing less than a 10 from me!</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful.  What a shot!  Nothing less than a 10 from me!', '2006-07-10 00:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605044, 354629, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love these flowers!  I like the image, with just the one buttercup in focus, most of the rest slightly out of focus to completely blurred.  Beautiful colours.  (7)</td>', 'I love these flowers!  I like the image, with just the one buttercup in focus, most of the rest slightly out of focus to completely blurred.  Beautiful colours.  (7)', '2006-07-10 00:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605046, 356104, 58438, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful.  Definitly ribbon material!</td>', 'This is so beautiful.  Definitly ribbon material!', '2006-07-10 00:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605048, 356783, 58438, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous Shot!</td>', 'Gorgeous Shot!', '2006-07-10 00:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605057, 356376, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I''m glad I got around to seeing this one.  It''s beautiful!  The white petals look like crumpled silk.  (9)</td>', 'Wow!  I''m glad I got around to seeing this one.  It''s beautiful!  The white petals look like crumpled silk.  (9)', '2006-07-10 00:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605090, 356118, 27767, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the idea for this shot. The shallow DOF is great, though I think it is a little too shallow here since the very tip of the stamen is out of focus. The frame feels a little intrusive to me. If it were backed off to within 5 pixels of the side I think it would look better.</td>', 'I absolutely love the idea for this shot. The shallow DOF is great, though I think it is a little too shallow here since the very tip of the stamen is out of focus. The frame feels a little intrusive to me. If it were backed off to within 5 pixels of the side I think it would look better.', '2006-07-10 00:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605105, 355653, 33068, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and composition.</td>', 'Lovely colors and composition.', '2006-07-10 00:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
