(2605338, 355488, 48228, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot Sandy, and so richly deserved..... Way to go girl..... You really are working so well with the number of images in the sixes.....</td>', 'Stunning shot Sandy, and so richly deserved..... Way to go girl..... You really are working so well with the number of images in the sixes.....', '2006-07-10 01:31:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2605342, 353994, 5112, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much for all the comments and the votes :)  I''m very happy, I love flowers!<br/> <br/>Sorry about not listing the details, I thought I had, but I guess I forgot once again.<br/> <br/>Image made indoors, by a bright window in the afternoon.  Used my trusty macro lens.<br/> <br/>The image was shot RAW, most processing done in Nikon Capture Editor (adjusted exposure, curves, saturation).  Saved as TIFF.<br/> <br/>Opened in PSP9, cloned out a couple imperfections, adjusted colours a bit more, resized, noise reduction, sharpened, saved as JPG.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you so much for all the comments and the votes :)  I''m very happy, I love flowers! Sorry about not listing the details, I thought I had, but I guess I forgot once again. Image made indoors, by a bright window in the afternoon.  Used my trusty macro lens. The image was shot RAW, most processing done in Nikon Capture Editor (adjusted exposure, curves, saturation).  Saved as TIFF. Opened in PSP9, cloned out a couple imperfections, adjusted colours a bit more, resized, noise reduction, sharpened, saved as JPG. ', '2006-07-10 01:31:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2605347, 354195, 59415, '<td valign="top">I really should have listened to my wife and entered a diffrent one...lol  Thanks for the kind comments from a few of you.  There is something about this flower that is hypnotic.  I really like it still.</td>', 'I really should have listened to my wife and entered a diffrent one...lol  Thanks for the kind comments from a few of you.  There is something about this flower that is hypnotic.  I really like it still.', '2006-07-10 01:32:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2605350, 355394, 31403, '<td valign="top">Of course it would be YOU!  You''ve taught me well in two areas this week - THANK YOU!!<br/></td>', 'Of course it would be YOU!  You''ve taught me well in two areas this week - THANK YOU!!', '2006-07-10 01:33:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2605352, 355215, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats. Excellent composition.</td>', 'Congrats. Excellent composition.', '2006-07-10 01:33:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2605355, 355225, 18367, '<td valign="top">I rather like this image, and commend you on your ability to transform a rather mundane subject to a captivating piece of art.  Don''t let the naysayers detract you from your objectives.  Wonderful work... keep it up.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'I rather like this image, and commend you on your ability to transform a rather mundane subject to a captivating piece of art.  Don''t let the naysayers detract you from your objectives.  Wonderful work... keep it up. Ray', '2006-07-10 01:33:41.000000', NULL, 0),
