(2606187, 357166, 34192, '<td valign="top">Strictly my opinion, take it for what its worth...The score on this image, I believe, is not due to the quality of the image, its due to its relation to the topic.  You have a very pretty flower but not a wow flower, in a challenge full of wow flowers.  If this were a challenge on cakes, I think this would have done a little better, as you captured the cake with good lighting (so many pictures of food here have bad lighting making the food look inedible!).  To up your score a little more, you might have taken the shot at an angle more flattering to the cake (not cropped through the middle of the cake).  The background works well as does the natural white lighting on the whole scene.  Maybe try a square crop that includes the bottom of the cake with part of a plate in a complementary color.  At any rate, remember that part of your score is always going to be relation to the challenge.  Quality of the image itself only plays a part.  You got some 10s, 9s, and 8s.  Can''t be all bad! :)</td>', 'Strictly my opinion, take it for what its worth...The score on this image, I believe, is not due to the quality of the image, its due to its relation to the topic.  You have a very pretty flower but not a wow flower, in a challenge full of wow flowers.  If this were a challenge on cakes, I think this would have done a little better, as you captured the cake with good lighting (so many pictures of food here have bad lighting making the food look inedible!).  To up your score a little more, you might have taken the shot at an angle more flattering to the cake (not cropped through the middle of the cake).  The background works well as does the natural white lighting on the whole scene.  Maybe try a square crop that includes the bottom of the cake with part of a plate in a complementary color.  At any rate, remember that part of your score is always going to be relation to the challenge.  Quality of the image itself only plays a part.  You got some 10s, 9s, and 8s.  Can''t be all bad! :)', '2006-07-10 07:36:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2606206, 356704, 9821, '<td valign="top">much respect for your honesty ... don''t give it a second thought. Looks like I was pretty far away from 3rd (0.3 is more than a single 3).<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hotpasta:</b></div><hr/><i> I have to give you my humblest apologies...this was one of my favourites in the challenge...I loved everything about it and gave it a 9...I don''t know what happened, but it registered a 3 for some reason, which was obviously a mistake...sorry if it made any difference between you getting third or 4th (I doubt it)...great shot and a fantastic impact as soon as you see it on the screen...congratulations </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'much respect for your honesty ... don''t give it a second thought. Looks like I was pretty far away from 3rd (0.3 is more than a single 3). :) Originally posted by hotpasta: I have to give you my humblest apologies...this was one of my favourites in the challenge...I loved everything about it and gave it a 9...I don''t know what happened, but it registered a 3 for some reason, which was obviously a mistake...sorry if it made any difference between you getting third or 4th (I doubt it)...great shot and a fantastic impact as soon as you see it on the screen...congratulations ', '2006-07-10 07:46:47.000000', NULL, 0),
