(2606941, 356131, 20530, '<td valign="top">I would have given it a 9. It''s beautifully executed and incredibly creative. It''s also jarring and unsettling, which contradicts the flower stereotype. My guess is that the voters had been lulled into a hypnotic state, and shocked awake when they came to it. Some people just don''t like to be shocked. I do; and I love this shot!</td>', 'I would have given it a 9. It''s beautifully executed and incredibly creative. It''s also jarring and unsettling, which contradicts the flower stereotype. My guess is that the voters had been lulled into a hypnotic state, and shocked awake when they came to it. Some people just don''t like to be shocked. I do; and I love this shot!', '2006-07-10 12:15:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2606943, 355816, 4226, '<td valign="top">that is totally under-rated. Great lighting and its a wondeful capture, but I think dpc voters didn''t like the flowers which looks like mask here</td>', 'that is totally under-rated. Great lighting and its a wondeful capture, but I think dpc voters didn''t like the flowers which looks like mask here', '2006-07-10 12:16:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2606960, 353994, 4226, '<td valign="top">congrats! A great image which caught my eye while going through the thumbnails and it looked even better in full size than it looked in thumbnails. I was expecting this to be on the front page. <br/> <br/>Very well done and congrats on your personal best!</td>', 'congrats! A great image which caught my eye while going through the thumbnails and it looked even better in full size than it looked in thumbnails. I was expecting this to be on the front page.  Very well done and congrats on your personal best!', '2006-07-10 12:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2606965, 356704, 4226, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, the blue pops out in the yellow, great deatail.</td>', 'Nicely done, the blue pops out in the yellow, great deatail.', '2006-07-10 12:22:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607005, 353994, 49652, '<td valign="top">So very beautiful!  Congrats.</td>', 'So very beautiful!  Congrats.', '2006-07-10 12:41:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607008, 356765, 28710, '<td valign="top">Very, very, very nicely done!<br/> <br/>That''s pretty damn close to being a perfectly managed DOF...<br/> <br/>Your choice of lighting has added depth to the image in very good ways, but I''m a bit less excited about the preponderance of greys...</td>', 'Very, very, very nicely done! That''s pretty damn close to being a perfectly managed DOF... Your choice of lighting has added depth to the image in very good ways, but I''m a bit less excited about the preponderance of greys...', '2006-07-10 12:41:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607016, 357284, 34192, '<td valign="top">wow.  this is very painterly.  I like it a lot.  Excellent lighting for this image.  Reminds me of OKeefe.</td>', 'wow.  this is very painterly.  I like it a lot.  Excellent lighting for this image.  Reminds me of OKeefe.', '2006-07-10 12:46:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607034, 353994, 19670, '<td valign="top">A beautiful composition! The texture on the petals is great, and I really like the placement of the focus and how well the blurred areas work with the purity of the coloring.</td>', 'A beautiful composition! The texture on the petals is great, and I really like the placement of the focus and how well the blurred areas work with the purity of the coloring.', '2006-07-10 12:54:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607037, 353994, 3724, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.... brilliant glow on this underside of a summer umbrella.<br/>Nothing less than SPLENDID!</td>', 'Congratulations.... brilliant glow on this underside of a summer umbrella.Nothing less than SPLENDID!', '2006-07-10 12:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607065, 356765, 37215, '<td valign="top">Well done Matthew - a beautiful shot!</td>', 'Well done Matthew - a beautiful shot!', '2006-07-10 13:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607066, 356495, 56658, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Beaglemum:</b></div><hr/><i> sadfsa </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m sorry but I have no idea what this means.</td>', 'Originally posted by Beaglemum: sadfsa   I''m sorry but I have no idea what this means.', '2006-07-10 13:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607185, 356037, 40718, '<td valign="top">OK, it''s our buddy the magnolia again.  You can see how the composition changed your score.  This is nicely off centered and the petals don''t look quite so mangled in the center.<br/> <br/>If you used a flash on this, I think I can see a slight blue cast to the picture.  The reds of the morning sun are nice though and you chose a good time of the day to shoot.  The background is nicely blurred although I would have tried to do something about the horizontal line to the left.  It distracts and doesn''t help the feel of the picture at all.  Either remove whatever it was in composition, or clone it out in processing.<br/> <br/>You did nicely to keep the bright petal from blowing completely.  The little fly is a nice secondary subject as well.</td>', 'OK, it''s our buddy the magnolia again.  You can see how the composition changed your score.  This is nicely off centered and the petals don''t look quite so mangled in the center. If you used a flash on this, I think I can see a slight blue cast to the picture.  The reds of the morning sun are nice though and you chose a good time of the day to shoot.  The background is nicely blurred although I would have tried to do something about the horizontal line to the left.  It distracts and doesn''t help the feel of the picture at all.  Either remove whatever it was in composition, or clone it out in processing. You did nicely to keep the bright petal from blowing completely.  The little fly is a nice secondary subject as well.', '2006-07-10 13:32:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607200, 353994, 57882, '<td valign="top">Had to come back and leave a second comment.<br/> <br/>Very aesthetically pleasing.  I think you''ve capture most, if not all, the colors of a rainbow here.  Love the lines and the soft texture.<br/> <br/>Truly a great shot! Congrats!</td>', 'Had to come back and leave a second comment. Very aesthetically pleasing.  I think you''ve capture most, if not all, the colors of a rainbow here.  Love the lines and the soft texture. Truly a great shot! Congrats!', '2006-07-10 13:36:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607225, 355162, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I''d have to brainstorm a bit to see how it could be better pulled off.  The flower looks like the rising sun (which is what I think you were going after).  One issue is it is far too centered.  Zooming back a bit and giving some negative space would be a good idea.<br/> <br/>You processing may have cost you a bit too.  The yellows look a bit oversaturated and we are losing detail (which is why I think it looks OOF rather than actually being OOF).  There also seems to be a halo around the flower perimeter.  Finally there is noise in the blue sky (not uncommon at all as the blue channel is the noisiest on digital sensors).  Check out Neat Image.  There is a free version and after you do the standard use-it-too-much bit, it can be a very helpful tool for noise like that.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I''d have to brainstorm a bit to see how it could be better pulled off.  The flower looks like the rising sun (which is what I think you were going after).  One issue is it is far too centered.  Zooming back a bit and giving some negative space would be a good idea. You processing may have cost you a bit too.  The yellows look a bit oversaturated and we are losing detail (which is why I think it looks OOF rather than actually being OOF).  There also seems to be a halo around the flower perimeter.  Finally there is noise in the blue sky (not uncommon at all as the blue channel is the noisiest on digital sensors).  Check out Neat Image.  There is a free version and after you do the standard use-it-too-much bit, it can be a very helpful tool for noise like that.', '2006-07-10 13:48:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607284, 357284, 32754, '<td valign="top">lovely image and composition</td>', 'lovely image and composition', '2006-07-10 14:07:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607286, 357141, 52336, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and lovely duotone effect.  Very satisfying.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and lovely duotone effect.  Very satisfying.', '2006-07-10 14:09:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607287, 356495, 40718, '<td valign="top">Check your in-camera settings.  Although this is straight out of the camera I find that reds (and pinks) saturate very, very quickly on the Canon sensor.  If you shoot JPG and have the saturation boosted at all in camera it is even more of a problem.  I lost a whole day of shooting tulips in April because of it.<br/> <br/>Your composition is nicely done with the off-centered subject and the virtual leading line of the flowers.<br/> <br/>Now the reality is (and you know this as well as I do) that an unprocessed picture is not going to be able to stand up to a processed one.  Especially in a constricting challenge where all the shots are of one subject.</td>', 'Check your in-camera settings.  Although this is straight out of the camera I find that reds (and pinks) saturate very, very quickly on the Canon sensor.  If you shoot JPG and have the saturation boosted at all in camera it is even more of a problem.  I lost a whole day of shooting tulips in April because of it. Your composition is nicely done with the off-centered subject and the virtual leading line of the flowers. Now the reality is (and you know this as well as I do) that an unprocessed picture is not going to be able to stand up to a processed one.  Especially in a constricting challenge where all the shots are of one subject.', '2006-07-10 14:09:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607290, 356903, 32754, '<td valign="top">wonderful image...I like the way you presented the colors, and the butterfly just adds a punch to the image''s unique angle.</td>', 'wonderful image...I like the way you presented the colors, and the butterfly just adds a punch to the image''s unique angle.', '2006-07-10 14:09:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607295, 356340, 32754, '<td valign="top">nicely done, lovely tones.</td>', 'nicely done, lovely tones.', '2006-07-10 14:11:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607298, 356288, 32754, '<td valign="top">this is one interesting flower...</td>', 'this is one interesting flower...', '2006-07-10 14:12:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607308, 357186, 37730, '<td valign="top">fantastic photo.</td>', 'fantastic photo.', '2006-07-10 14:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607316, 356903, 37730, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-07-10 14:17:16.000000', NULL, 0),
