(2607337, 357032, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Ragga!!  He is BEAUTIFUL!  I was hoping he would be making his photographic debut here soon.  I couldn''t wait to see him!<br/> <br/>I think this is precious!!!  My heart is mush now for the rest of the day!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Ragga!!  He is BEAUTIFUL!  I was hoping he would be making his photographic debut here soon.  I couldn''t wait to see him! I think this is precious!!!  My heart is mush now for the rest of the day!!!! ', '2006-07-10 14:22:37.000000', NULL, 0),
