(2607634, 356851, 32997, '<td valign="top">ok so it is obvious that the flowers aren''t in focus..now I just wish people would get the obvious out of the way and start looking at what you are seeing..inviting us into the world of flowers...letting us observe the world from their point of view, a life of beauty surrounded by life and death struggles..<br/>There is a reason I don''t let scores affect me...scores don''t stop and consider, contemplate, pause.</td>', 'ok so it is obvious that the flowers aren''t in focus..now I just wish people would get the obvious out of the way and start looking at what you are seeing..inviting us into the world of flowers...letting us observe the world from their point of view, a life of beauty surrounded by life and death struggles..There is a reason I don''t let scores affect me...scores don''t stop and consider, contemplate, pause.', '2006-07-10 15:51:02.000000', NULL, 0),
