(2608712, 357064, 35804, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I like the sunflowers better open or closed...they look so cool both ways! Nicely done Sher...as usual  : }</td>', 'I can''t decide if I like the sunflowers better open or closed...they look so cool both ways! Nicely done Sher...as usual  : }', '2006-07-10 21:31:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2608717, 356213, 16912, '<td valign="top">Super shot ''T'' and well done on your first challenge! Your desat and painting back of the colour is very natural (I''d not of known if you had not said). I agree with electina and a touch better focus might have seen this in the top 20.</td>', 'Super shot ''T'' and well done on your first challenge! Your desat and painting back of the colour is very natural (I''d not of known if you had not said). I agree with electina and a touch better focus might have seen this in the top 20.', '2006-07-10 21:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2608756, 355488, 37719, '<td valign="top">You were robbed - one of the better compositions in the challenge hands down!  The softness of the shot and the lighting really set a tranquil mood that is very hard to capture.  It may be a bit bright on the tips, but I think the subtle colors - lavenders/purples take that away.  Nice high-key effect.  There is a really nice blend and transition from top to bottom in the shot that sets this apart IMO - soft to hard.  Very well done Sandy!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-10 20:54:25.</i></td>', 'You were robbed - one of the better compositions in the challenge hands down!  The softness of the shot and the lighting really set a tranquil mood that is very hard to capture.  It may be a bit bright on the tips, but I think the subtle colors - lavenders/purples take that away.  Nice high-key effect.  There is a really nice blend and transition from top to bottom in the shot that sets this apart IMO - soft to hard.  Very well done Sandy!', '2006-07-10 21:53:08.000000', '2006-07-10 21:54:25.000000', 0),
(2608805, 354701, 37779, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea and great outcome! A lot more creative than most of the shots in front of you, but still an pretty good finish!</td>', 'Fantastic idea and great outcome! A lot more creative than most of the shots in front of you, but still an pretty good finish!', '2006-07-10 22:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2608869, 356440, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition...my only criticism would be the centering.  the colors are good and I love the lighting used.  The textures go very well together.  The constant disruption of the background is a lovely technique you used quite well.  IMO, being centered works with the border applied, with no border I would like to see it a bit off in one direction or another.  Nice shot, well done!</td>', 'Very interesting composition...my only criticism would be the centering.  the colors are good and I love the lighting used.  The textures go very well together.  The constant disruption of the background is a lovely technique you used quite well.  IMO, being centered works with the border applied, with no border I would like to see it a bit off in one direction or another.  Nice shot, well done!', '2006-07-10 22:22:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2608905, 356320, 53701, '<td valign="top">i love the color''s</td>', 'i love the color''s', '2006-07-10 22:32:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2608931, 357099, 30982, '<td valign="top">Must be a day for 7s.  I gave this a 7 as well.  I really, really like that the flowers were used in context of something, which is something very few people (me included) did.  Position of your young model in the frame is excellent, as is her expression.  Background is quiet but textured.  Maybe just a bit too much light on her shoulder and not enough on her face, but quite a lovely picture!</td>', 'Must be a day for 7s.  I gave this a 7 as well.  I really, really like that the flowers were used in context of something, which is something very few people (me included) did.  Position of your young model in the frame is excellent, as is her expression.  Background is quiet but textured.  Maybe just a bit too much light on her shoulder and not enough on her face, but quite a lovely picture!', '2006-07-10 22:41:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2608966, 353994, 10268, '<td valign="top">This is the best shot of a flower I have ever seen.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'This is the best shot of a flower I have ever seen. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2006-07-10 22:48:11.000000', NULL, 0),
