(2609054, 357186, 14386, '<td valign="top">Amazing Shannon.  Not a set-up shot this time but you still rocks!  I am in awe with how your mind works.  The photographic skill is a given.</td>', 'Amazing Shannon.  Not a set-up shot this time but you still rocks!  I am in awe with how your mind works.  The photographic skill is a given.', '2006-07-10 23:14:42.000000', NULL, 0),
