(2609367, 356909, 8891, '<td valign="top">Glad to see you stuck around.  Love the composition on this very much, especially the forms you caught....makes it very interesting. Congrats on a great finish...you certainly beat me by quite a bit. And you''re right about arranging them....I usually resort to twist tying the stalks together out of the frame ;)!</td>', 'Glad to see you stuck around.  Love the composition on this very much, especially the forms you caught....makes it very interesting. Congrats on a great finish...you certainly beat me by quite a bit. And you''re right about arranging them....I usually resort to twist tying the stalks together out of the frame ;)!', '2006-07-11 00:22:59.000000', NULL, 0),
