(2609460, 357323, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice, and an interesting composition.  Not sure if the vignetting is burned in or not, but it works well.  I like the crop, and the distortion offered by the wide angle.  That and the unusual composition add to what I think is a disorienting feel.  Well done.  No idea what the title means. :)</td>', 'Nice, and an interesting composition.  Not sure if the vignetting is burned in or not, but it works well.  I like the crop, and the distortion offered by the wide angle.  That and the unusual composition add to what I think is a disorienting feel.  Well done.  No idea what the title means. :)', '2006-07-11 00:45:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2609488, 357320, 27133, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and a good score in such a large range of entries.  And you are one of the lucky ones...you didn''t get any one''s or two''s on this entry....well done.</td>', 'Very pretty and a good score in such a large range of entries.  And you are one of the lucky ones...you didn''t get any one''s or two''s on this entry....well done.', '2006-07-11 00:53:19.000000', NULL, 0),
