(2611110, 356395, 52336, '<td valign="top">Beautiful effect, with a calming composition that really satisfies.  I like the understated colours, and the reflectivity of colour in the blossoms and vase.  There''s a kind of dark band along the left edge that is noticeable to me - I don''t know if this was burned in or not, but it may be better if omitted, though it could be argued that it acts as a soft frame for the image.  Overall, well done.</td>', 'Beautiful effect, with a calming composition that really satisfies.  I like the understated colours, and the reflectivity of colour in the blossoms and vase.  There''s a kind of dark band along the left edge that is noticeable to me - I don''t know if this was burned in or not, but it may be better if omitted, though it could be argued that it acts as a soft frame for the image.  Overall, well done.', '2006-07-11 14:35:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2611120, 356566, 52336, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft effect, both in the muted green colour, the softness in the bloom, and the high-key treatment.  Really nice.  I like the sparseness offered by the bud and the de-petaled (?) blossom; it contrasts well with the full fresh flower.</td>', 'Beautiful soft effect, both in the muted green colour, the softness in the bloom, and the high-key treatment.  Really nice.  I like the sparseness offered by the bud and the de-petaled (?) blossom; it contrasts well with the full fresh flower.', '2006-07-11 14:38:09.000000', NULL, 0),
