(2659556, 357346, 51386, '<td valign="top">Very Romantic shot. I like how the soft focus matches the lighting. I would like to see a bit of a more interesting posture that exposes the curves of the body though, as the flowers on it inspire a sense of exploration. If the shapes were more defined, it would be a more pleasing photo inmo. dont get me wrong though, this is a great shot and i love it! Just thinking out loud.</td>', 'Very Romantic shot. I like how the soft focus matches the lighting. I would like to see a bit of a more interesting posture that exposes the curves of the body though, as the flowers on it inspire a sense of exploration. If the shapes were more defined, it would be a more pleasing photo inmo. dont get me wrong though, this is a great shot and i love it! Just thinking out loud.', '2006-07-25 19:02:18.000000', NULL, 0),
