(2840976, 355394, 57882, '<td valign="top">Great symbolism here, very much supported by the excellent composition.  The colors seem slightly over-saturated, but still believable.  I want to feel sorrow, but the bright vibrant colors are not letting me.</td>', 'Great symbolism here, very much supported by the excellent composition.  The colors seem slightly over-saturated, but still believable.  I want to feel sorrow, but the bright vibrant colors are not letting me.', '2006-09-16 17:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2841371, 357328, 6306, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition.</td>', 'Awesome composition.', '2006-09-16 21:39:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2854971, 355225, 64571, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love this.  What an awesome idea!  It makes me want to paint it.</td>', 'Wow!  I love this.  What an awesome idea!  It makes me want to paint it.', '2006-09-21 20:29:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2856397, 357328, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this got lost in the shuffle during the zillions of flowers in the challenge.  I like that it isn''t just a single flower and the DOF shows the ones behind it.  It almost looks like an umbrella.  Maybe the crop  which cut off the entire blossom hurt you a bit, but the vivid fuschia and green just jumps out of the thumbnails.  Enjoying your portfolio!</td>', 'I think this got lost in the shuffle during the zillions of flowers in the challenge.  I like that it isn''t just a single flower and the DOF shows the ones behind it.  It almost looks like an umbrella.  Maybe the crop  which cut off the entire blossom hurt you a bit, but the vivid fuschia and green just jumps out of the thumbnails.  Enjoying your portfolio!', '2006-09-22 10:36:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2858823, 357135, 20530, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know what plant this is. It is very similar to the blooms of my elephant ear. Because of this I have a great deal of respect for your technique. I tried, unsuccesfully, to get a decent image and couldn''t get the contrast right. You''ve done a great job of representing the texture and light in this image. Nice work!</td>', 'I''d love to know what plant this is. It is very similar to the blooms of my elephant ear. Because of this I have a great deal of respect for your technique. I tried, unsuccesfully, to get a decent image and couldn''t get the contrast right. You''ve done a great job of representing the texture and light in this image. Nice work!', '2006-09-23 13:49:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2864916, 355449, 42196, '<td valign="top">Nice warm but crisp/brisk light (crisp b/c the wb is somewhat cool maybe?) and framing.<br/>Not sure what focal length you shot at but I would have liked to have seen it longer and the aperture bigger to blur that flower in the background more.<br/>Also would have been nice if the inside of the flower had some more direct light from the sun... maybe a reflector would have helped here.<br/> <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice warm but crisp/brisk light (crisp b/c the wb is somewhat cool maybe?) and framing.Not sure what focal length you shot at but I would have liked to have seen it longer and the aperture bigger to blur that flower in the background more.Also would have been nice if the inside of the flower had some more direct light from the sun... maybe a reflector would have helped here. Nice shot.', '2006-09-26 00:42:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2865680, 355958, 39144, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is an awesome photo. Very creative and well done.</td>', 'Wow! This is an awesome photo. Very creative and well done.', '2006-09-26 10:41:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2876007, 356757, 48954, '<td valign="top">centered in a square crop would have made a huge difference here</td>', 'centered in a square crop would have made a huge difference here', '2006-09-29 15:36:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2913130, 355958, 22734, '<td valign="top">A super capture and quite creative. The idea to insert the flowers give it that "wow" factor. Nice work.</td>', 'A super capture and quite creative. The idea to insert the flowers give it that "wow" factor. Nice work.', '2006-10-10 01:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2923128, 356019, 35602, '<td valign="top">I love the green contrasting background with the bright red orange of the flower.  I think the dof is just fine.  The only thing that might make the image stronger is if the flower is not so centered.  Alot of times I will also tilt the camera in such a way that the stem or a leaf is coming in from the corner to lead the eye to the subject of the flower.  You really did a great job on the color balance on this one.  Got the color nearly perfect for the type of flower it is.</td>', 'I love the green contrasting background with the bright red orange of the flower.  I think the dof is just fine.  The only thing that might make the image stronger is if the flower is not so centered.  Alot of times I will also tilt the camera in such a way that the stem or a leaf is coming in from the corner to lead the eye to the subject of the flower.  You really did a great job on the color balance on this one.  Got the color nearly perfect for the type of flower it is.', '2006-10-12 16:39:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2926811, 355958, 7810, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot with a great result ... very creative.</td>', 'This is a great shot with a great result ... very creative.', '2006-10-13 20:21:42.000000', NULL, 0),
